♪ IS MUCH BETTER THAN ♪

232
00:09:07,548 --> 00:09:09,817
♪ THE FINDER
OF THE LOST LOVES ♪

233
00:09:14,888 --> 00:09:17,258
TOM CRUISE--
DAYS OF THUNDER.

234
00:09:17,258 --> 00:09:18,927
OH, NO, IT’S A BOTTLE

235
00:09:18,927 --> 00:09:20,962
OF ROYAL CROWN COLA,
IS WHAT THAT IS.

236
00:09:20,962 --> 00:09:22,430
IT’S A HOOVER UPRIGHT.

237
00:09:22,430 --> 00:09:24,798
I THINK IT’S A VIBRATING
FOOTBALL DUDE.

238
00:09:24,798 --> 00:09:26,467
YOU KNOW, IT’S NOT SO MUCH
THE APOCALYPSE,

239
00:09:26,467 --> 00:09:28,368
- IT’S THE HUMIDITY.
- OH, YAH, I KNOW.

240
00:09:28,368 --> 00:09:31,405
HAD CLAUDE MONET
DIRECTED THIS PICTURE.

241
00:09:31,405 --> 00:09:35,042
MM, THIS CHARACTER’S
NOT VERY WELL-DEFINED.

242
00:09:35,042 --> 00:09:38,745
JEEZ, I COULD JUST STAND
IN FRONT OF MY OVEN.

243
00:09:38,745 --> 00:09:41,048
WHO ARE YOU?

244
00:09:41,048 --> 00:09:42,650
THE HIGH PLAINS LOSER.

245
00:09:45,318 --> 00:09:46,720
YOU KNOW, IT’S REALLY
KIND OF INTRIGUING

246
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:48,555
HOW HE JUST
COMES TOWARDS YOU.

247
00:09:48,555 --> 00:09:51,892
- MM-HMM.
- COMPELLING.
- INTRIGUING.

248
00:09:51,892 --> 00:09:53,860
OH, HE’S A SHRINER.
SEE, HE’S GOT A SHOTGUN

249
00:09:53,860 --> 00:09:55,328
THAT SHOOTS CANDY!

250
00:09:55,328 --> 00:09:57,432
WATCH OUT FOR THE TACK!

251
00:09:59,500 --> 00:10:01,202
CHECK THIS OUT.

252
00:10:01,202 --> 00:10:03,037
[BOTS LAUGH]

253
00:10:03,037 --> 00:10:06,173
OH, HE MUST BE GOING
40 OR 45.

254
00:10:06,173 --> 00:10:08,075
SCALE MILES AN HOUR?

255
00:10:08,075 --> 00:10:10,277
UH, MRS. WEBB,
THE ACCELERATOR’S STUCK.

256
00:10:10,277 --> 00:10:11,945
MRS. WEBB,
MY LEGS ARE ON FIRE.

257
00:10:11,945 --> 00:10:13,480
HIT THE CHUTE!

258
00:10:13,480 --> 00:10:16,417
HI, I’M DWAYNE-- I MEAN,
THE WARRIOR OF THE LOST WORLD.

259
00:10:19,387 --> 00:10:22,055
HELLO, THERE.

260
00:10:22,055 --> 00:10:23,257
HEY, WHERE ARE YOU GOIN’?

261
00:10:23,257 --> 00:10:24,525
NOWHERE IN PARTICULAR.

262
00:10:24,525 --> 00:10:25,860
MAN, I WISH I WAS YOU.

263
00:10:25,860 --> 00:10:27,127
YEAH, WELL, HANG IN THERE.

264
00:10:27,127 --> 00:10:30,197
REMOVE THE COWLING,
IT’S A RUPP ROADSTER.

265
00:10:30,197 --> 00:10:31,532
WELL, HE’S A WELL-ORGANIZED

266
00:10:31,532 --> 00:10:33,500
WARRIOR OF THE LOST WORLD,
HE IS.

267
00:10:33,500 --> 00:10:35,335
- MORNING, EINSTEIN.
- HUH?

268
00:10:35,335 --> 00:10:37,037
- WHAT?
- BEEP. BEEP.

269
00:10:37,037 --> 00:10:39,673
MOTORCYCLE IS CLOSE-CAPTIONED
FOR THE HEARING-IMPAIRED.

270
00:10:39,673 --> 00:10:41,575
HUMOR-IMPAIRED.

271
00:10:41,575 --> 00:10:43,977
OH, IS IT TOO EARLY
TO KILL MYSELF?

272
00:10:46,147 --> 00:10:48,715
YOU KNOW, EARLY DAVID WORTH
IS VERY INTERESTING

273
00:10:48,715 --> 00:10:50,183
IN LIGHT OF HIS LATER FILMS.

274
00:10:50,183 --> 00:10:52,353
MM-HMM-- HUH?

275
00:10:52,353 --> 00:10:53,920
THE BIRD POLICE.

276
00:10:53,920 --> 00:10:55,588
OH, IT REALLY LOOKS
FUTURISTIC, DOESN’T IT?

277
00:10:55,588 --> 00:10:57,090
’CAUSE IT’S GOT
BUMPERS LIKE--

278
00:10:57,090 --> 00:10:58,692
THERE ARE NONE
LIKE THAT RIGHT NOW.

279
00:10:58,692 --> 00:11:00,527
HUH?

280
00:11:02,763 --> 00:11:06,667
YOU SEE, THERE ARE
NO BUMPERS LIKE THIS.

281
00:11:06,667 --> 00:11:09,403
OH, THEY MISSPELLED
"PERIMETER."

282
00:11:15,075 --> 00:11:18,912
HARDCASTLE AND McCORMICK.

283
00:11:18,912 --> 00:11:20,147
POLICE SQUAD!

284
00:11:20,147 --> 00:11:21,882
N.Y.P.D.

285
00:11:21,882 --> 00:11:23,917
TIMES TWO.

286
00:11:23,917 --> 00:11:26,420
TWO CONTROL UNITS
ARE DISPATCHED.

287
00:11:26,420 --> 00:11:28,022
OVERTAKE AND TERMINATE.

288
00:11:28,022 --> 00:11:29,490
REPEAT, OVERTAKE
AND TERMINATE.

289
00:11:29,490 --> 00:11:32,058
WHAT, IS JOHN MERRICK
THE DISPATCHER?

290
00:11:32,058 --> 00:11:34,428
[CROW AS JOHN HURT]
UH, PICK UP AT THE AIRPORT.

291
00:11:38,398 --> 00:11:41,068
COME ON, GRANDMA,
THEY’RE ALL PASSING US!

292
00:11:41,068 --> 00:11:43,403
[BOTS MIMIC ENGINES]

293
00:11:44,838 --> 00:11:47,875
- RING-RING-RING-RING...
- GWAAA! GWAAA!

294
00:11:49,277 --> 00:11:50,543
IT’S ON THIS STRAIGHTAWAY

295
00:11:50,543 --> 00:11:52,480
THAT FITTIPALDI
SHOULD BE ABLE TO GAIN

296
00:11:52,480 --> 00:11:54,248
SOME GROUND ON THE LEADERS.

297
00:11:57,552 --> 00:11:58,885
[COMPUTER]
BAD MOTHERS! BAD MOTHERS!

298
00:11:58,885 --> 00:12:00,553
AND THE BAD FATHERS
THAT LOVE THEM.

299
00:12:00,553 --> 00:12:02,088
TODAY ON DONAHUE.

300
00:12:02,088 --> 00:12:04,958
NOW, HOW DOES A COMPUTER KNOW
THEY HAVE BAD MOTHERS?

301
00:12:06,527 --> 00:12:07,862
SUBSONIC.

302
00:12:07,862 --> 00:12:09,263
[SERVO MIMICS DRAWL]

303
00:12:09,263 --> 00:12:11,632
- SCREW ’EM.
- HOLD ON TO YOUR ASS!

304
00:12:11,632 --> 00:12:13,833
"HOLD ON TO YOUR" BLANK,
CHARLES NELSON REILLY.

305
00:12:13,833 --> 00:12:16,137
[CROW AS CHARLES NELSON REILLY]
I SAID "BIPPY."

306
00:12:16,137 --> 00:12:18,772
DING DING DING.

307
00:12:18,772 --> 00:12:21,475
WHAT? WHY DO YOU KEEP
LOOKING AT ME LIKE THAT?

308
00:12:23,810 --> 00:12:25,712
ULTIMATE, MAN.

309
00:12:25,712 --> 00:12:27,313
OH, COME ON,
YOU’D THINK IN THE FUTURE,

310
00:12:27,313 --> 00:12:30,717
THEY’D HAVE
BETTER GRAPHICS THAN PONG.

311
00:12:30,717 --> 00:12:33,453
THIS IMAGE PROPERTY
OF THE DISNEY CORPORATION.

312
00:12:33,453 --> 00:12:37,157
ALL RIGHTS RESERVED.

313
00:12:37,157 --> 00:12:39,058
[SERVO MIMICS ENGINE]

314
00:12:41,328 --> 00:12:43,597
TERMINATE ME.

315
00:12:43,597 --> 00:12:46,667
WHAT? DIDN’T I USE
MY DIRECTIONAL, HUH?

316
00:12:48,102 --> 00:12:51,838
BOY! BOY, IT’S EASY WITHOUT
MIRANDA, EH, SARGE?

317
00:12:54,742 --> 00:12:58,412
WATCH OUT FOR THE SQUIBS.

318
00:12:58,412 --> 00:13:01,348
ANOTHER GOOD USE
FOR BAKING SODA.

319
00:13:06,887 --> 00:13:09,423
OOH, THERE GOES
HIS GOLF SWING.

320
00:13:09,423 --> 00:13:10,825
DO IT TO IT.

321
00:13:10,825 --> 00:13:14,428
[COMPUTER]
BITE THIS! BITE THIS!

322
00:13:14,428 --> 00:13:16,163
MR. BUSEY, LOOK OUT!

323
00:13:16,163 --> 00:13:19,967
SORRY.

324
00:13:19,967 --> 00:13:22,002
BINGO! BINGO! BINGO!

325
00:13:22,002 --> 00:13:25,672
YEAH, ANOTHER BUDDHIST
PROTESTING THE HELMET LAWS.

326
00:13:25,672 --> 00:13:28,575
AND NOW, EDIE SEDGWICK
GOES ON THE ROAD.

327
00:13:32,847 --> 00:13:36,517
UH, COMING THROUGH. YEAH.

328
00:13:36,517 --> 00:13:39,453
NOW I’M THE JERK.

329
00:13:39,453 --> 00:13:40,922
OH, SORRY. SORRY.

330
00:13:40,922 --> 00:13:42,222
BOY, DON’T I FEEL STUPID.

331
00:13:42,222 --> 00:13:44,625
THAT’S COMPLETELY
MY FAULT, SORRY.

332
00:13:44,625 --> 00:13:46,360
WELL, WHAT CAN I SAY?
LIVE AND LEARN.

333
00:13:46,360 --> 00:13:48,228
YEP. SORRY.

334
00:13:48,228 --> 00:13:51,365
BOY, I FEEL LIKE
A PERFECT ASS.

335
00:13:51,365 --> 00:13:53,300
YEP, WELL.

336
00:13:53,300 --> 00:13:54,835
I HAD THE RIGHT OF WAY.

337
00:13:54,835 --> 00:13:57,638
I DID.

338
00:13:57,638 --> 00:13:59,273
HEY, LOOK, IT’S
THE PAPER CHASE GUY.

339
00:13:59,273 --> 00:14:00,840
- HEY.
- THERE HE IS.

340
00:14:00,840 --> 00:14:03,010
LOOKS LIKE HE’S HAD
SOME NOVOCAINE.

341
00:14:03,010 --> 00:14:04,512
ROUGH WAY TO START A DAY.

342
00:14:04,512 --> 00:14:07,147
[SERVO MIMICS DRAWL]
TOUGH WAY TO START A MOVIE.

343
00:14:07,147 --> 00:14:10,583
WELL, OFF TO DENNY’S.

344
00:14:10,583 --> 00:14:12,052
- OKAY, BUH-BYE.
- SEE YA.

345
00:14:12,052 --> 00:14:15,755
- SEE YA.
- BYE.

346
00:14:15,755 --> 00:14:17,958
GEE, OHIO LOOKS GREAT
AFTER THE APOCALYPSE.

347
00:14:17,958 --> 00:14:19,327
SO, UH, WHAT’S NEXT?

348
00:14:19,327 --> 00:14:21,128
BETTER CHECK MY DAY-TIMER.

349
00:14:24,965 --> 00:14:27,167
BAD MOTHERS! BAD MOTHERS!
BAD MOTHERS!

350
00:14:27,167 --> 00:14:30,170
YOU MEAN,
LIKE JOAN CRAWFORD?

351
00:14:30,170 --> 00:14:32,105
[SERVO AS BARRY WHITE]
OH BABY. WHEN YOU LOVE ME,

352
00:14:32,105 --> 00:14:33,907
- AND I LOVE YOUR LOVE.
- BARRY WHITE.

353
00:14:33,907 --> 00:14:37,712
WE ARE VERY BAD MOTHERS!

354
00:14:37,712 --> 00:14:39,580
OH, NO. COPS.

355
00:14:39,580 --> 00:14:41,282
ANY FRUIT TO DECLARE, SIR?

356
00:14:41,282 --> 00:14:42,850
[RIDER SIGHS]

357
00:14:42,850 --> 00:14:46,053
- NICE NEIGHBORHOOD.
- BUT I WOULDN’T WANT
TO ACT HERE.

358
00:14:46,053 --> 00:14:48,122
ANY FRUIT TO DECLARE?

359
00:14:50,457 --> 00:14:52,727
[ALL] ANY FRUIT TO DECLARE?!

360
00:14:52,727 --> 00:14:54,462
LET’S GO AIRBORNE.

361
00:14:54,462 --> 00:14:55,862
GRAB YOUR ASS!
GRAB YOUR ASS!

362
00:14:55,862 --> 00:14:57,898
UH, "GRAB YOUR" BLANK,
BRETT SOMERS?

363
00:14:57,898 --> 00:15:00,267
I SAID, "GRAB YOUR HINDER."

364
00:15:00,267 --> 00:15:03,037
UH, SEMI-AIRBORNE, I’D SAY.

365
00:15:03,037 --> 00:15:05,238
DO YOU HAVE ANY FRUIT?

366
00:15:07,507 --> 00:15:11,378
GUESS NOT, HUH?

367
00:15:11,378 --> 00:15:13,213
YOU ARE LOOKING LIVE
AT SOLD-OUT

368
00:15:13,213 --> 00:15:16,950
GOLDEN STATE COLISEUM-- OH.

369
00:15:16,950 --> 00:15:20,487
WELL, CALIFORNIA DOES
HAVE ITS BUDGET PROBLEMS.

370
00:15:20,487 --> 00:15:24,223
[SERVO SINGS
SANFORD AND SON]

371
00:15:24,223 --> 00:15:27,027
GRADY, THE PAPER CHASE
GUY IS HERE!

372
00:15:28,595 --> 00:15:31,165
SURE I DIDN’T TAKE
A WRONG TURN OR SOMETHING?

373
00:15:31,165 --> 00:15:33,933
PROBABLY BE ABLE TO FIND
A DISTRIBUTOR CAP ANYWAY.

374
00:15:35,702 --> 00:15:38,472
TRAFFIC IS STACKED UP TODAY
ON THE GOLDEN STATE FREEWAY.

375
00:15:38,472 --> 00:15:40,707
YOU MAY WANNA TRY
AN ALTERNATE ROUTE.

376
00:15:40,707 --> 00:15:42,475
I GOT A BEAT WITH A BUZZ
AT THREE PHASE.

377
00:15:42,475 --> 00:15:46,013
BOLSHEVIK IT.

378
00:15:46,013 --> 00:15:47,280
- RED CENTER.
- RETSYN?

379
00:15:47,280 --> 00:15:48,582
--KIDS AND GRINDERS, MOVE.

380
00:15:48,582 --> 00:15:51,385
THEY’RE ALL WEARING
DR. PEPPER LIP GLOSS.

381
00:15:53,587 --> 00:15:56,223
THEY’RE RENEGADE
BURGER KING WINDOW GUYS.

382
00:15:58,158 --> 00:16:00,193
IT’S JOAN CUSACK!

383
00:16:05,232 --> 00:16:08,235
- DORKS! DORKS!--
- HEY, YOU DON’T EVEN
KNOW THEM.

384
00:16:10,337 --> 00:16:12,538
WHUH-- HUH?

385
00:16:12,538 --> 00:16:14,575
VEG-OUTS,
AND THEY’RE ALL HERE

386
00:16:14,575 --> 00:16:16,710
TO PLAY THE FAMILY FEUD!

387
00:16:16,710 --> 00:16:20,180
- GEEKS! GEEKS!
- [JOEL HUMS TV THEME]

388
00:16:20,180 --> 00:16:22,315
- KIDS TODAY.
- YARBLES AND YARLBLOCKERS!

389
00:16:22,315 --> 00:16:25,052
BLOCKA-BLOCKLE?

390
00:16:25,052 --> 00:16:28,155
WE HATED YOU
IN THE PAPER CHASE!

391
00:16:28,155 --> 00:16:29,423
THANK YOU,
THANKS FOR THE BRICK.

392
00:16:29,423 --> 00:16:31,192
THANKS VERY MUCH.

393
00:16:31,192 --> 00:16:33,927
STIV BATORS? RICHARD HELL?

394
00:16:37,597 --> 00:16:39,467
OH, IT’S THE LITTLE THINGS
THAT MAKE YOU HAPPY.

395
00:16:39,467 --> 00:16:42,602
HE’S GONNA NEED A TWEEZER.

396
00:16:42,602 --> 00:16:43,870
OH BOY.

397
00:16:51,078 --> 00:16:53,180
BOY, THESE BLUEGRASS
FESTIVALS, I TELL YA.

398
00:16:53,180 --> 00:16:56,650
LET’S GET OUT OF HERE.

399
00:16:56,650 --> 00:16:59,953
HEY, THE AMISH
FINALLY GO COMBUSTION.

400
00:16:59,953 --> 00:17:02,188
COME ON BACK.

401
00:17:02,188 --> 00:17:04,023
- YOUR LUCKY DAY.
- AH, SHUT UP.

402
00:17:04,023 --> 00:17:07,460
A FIELD ZAMBONI?

403
00:17:07,460 --> 00:17:09,295
GIDDY UP! GIDDY UP!

404
00:17:11,465 --> 00:17:13,867
[ALL APPLAUD, CHEER]

405
00:17:13,867 --> 00:17:15,402
- COOL.
- AHH.

406
00:17:15,402 --> 00:17:17,805
YES.

407
00:17:17,805 --> 00:17:21,308
HANGAR 18.

408
00:17:21,308 --> 00:17:22,977
OH, KIND OF A, UH,

409
00:17:22,977 --> 00:17:24,277
CALIGULA MEETS COMA.

410
00:17:24,277 --> 00:17:25,478
♪ COMA-COMA-COMA-COMA ♪

411
00:17:25,478 --> 00:17:27,513
♪ COMA-CALIGULA ♪

412
00:17:27,513 --> 00:17:30,417
YOU KNOW, THAT’S GONNA HURT
WHEN THEY RIP THAT TAPE OFF.

413
00:17:32,252 --> 00:17:33,753
THE LAST TEMPTATION...

414
00:17:33,753 --> 00:17:35,722
OF RICK.

415
00:17:35,722 --> 00:17:37,623
FRED WILLIAMSON?

416
00:17:37,623 --> 00:17:39,560
WITH PANTS TUG.

417
00:17:42,195 --> 00:17:44,363
REAL WEIRD PACKAGE, DAVE.

418
00:17:46,833 --> 00:17:48,402
WHATEVER.

419
00:17:48,402 --> 00:17:51,272
DON’T THINK
HE’S GONNA MAKE IT.

420
00:17:51,272 --> 00:17:52,840
IN OUR WORLD,

421
00:17:52,840 --> 00:17:55,675
THE SPIRIT IS STRONGER
THAN THE FLESH.

422
00:17:55,675 --> 00:17:58,878
AGAIN, WHATEVER.

423
00:17:58,878 --> 00:18:01,548
TOVA BORGNINE, NO!

424
00:18:03,683 --> 00:18:06,720
GRANDMA, GET DRESSED.

425
00:18:06,720 --> 00:18:08,088
WHEN THE WHITE EAGLE
OF THE NORTH

426
00:18:08,088 --> 00:18:11,023
IS FLYING OVERHEAD...

427
00:18:11,023 --> 00:18:13,393
YOU KNOW, THIS IS CLOSER
THAN I EVER WANTED TO GET

428
00:18:13,393 --> 00:18:14,795
TO THE PAPER CHASE GUY.

429
00:18:14,795 --> 00:18:17,197
MM-HMM.

430
00:18:17,197 --> 00:18:20,400
HE’S LOST CONTROL
OF HIS MUSTACHE!

431
00:18:20,400 --> 00:18:23,170
OH, SHE’S BURNING ANTS
OFF HIS SHOULDER.

432
00:18:27,975 --> 00:18:29,510
DEAR EVEREADY,

433
00:18:29,510 --> 00:18:32,145
I WAS IN HEAVEN WHEN,
ALL OF A SUDDEN...

434
00:18:32,145 --> 00:18:34,380
OH, HE’S LOOKING
AWFULLY SMUG.

435
00:18:36,550 --> 00:18:39,620
HERE, DORIS, LET ME TAKE CARE
OF THIS ONE FOR YOU.

436
00:18:39,620 --> 00:18:42,857
THERE WE GO.

437
00:18:42,857 --> 00:18:44,492
IF THAT’S GOD, I’M QUITTING.

438
00:18:44,492 --> 00:18:46,693
YEAH, I THOUGHT
THE AFTERLIFE WOULD BE

439
00:18:46,693 --> 00:18:49,128
A LOT MORE CROWDED.
MORE LIKE ELLIS ISLAND.

440
00:18:49,128 --> 00:18:51,865
WELL, THERE WAS A BIG RUSH
RIGHT AFTER THE APOCALYPSE.

441
00:18:51,865 --> 00:18:55,535
THEN THINGS CALMED DOWN.

442
00:18:55,535 --> 00:18:57,037
WHAT YOU DOIN’?
GET YO HONKY ASS

443
00:18:57,037 --> 00:18:59,640
BACK DOWN ON THE FLO’!

444
00:19:03,043 --> 00:19:05,645
LITTLE, UH,
LIGHT IN THE LOAFERS.

445
00:19:05,645 --> 00:19:08,015
[SERVO CHUCKLES]
CUTE.

446
00:19:12,552 --> 00:19:14,788
IT’S BICYCLE REPAIRMAN!

447
00:19:14,788 --> 00:19:17,190
I DON’T REALLY
CARE ABOUT YOUR PROBLEMS

448
00:19:17,190 --> 00:19:18,892
WITH THE OMEGA.

449
00:19:18,892 --> 00:19:20,560
IT’S NONE OF MY BUSINESS.

450
00:19:20,560 --> 00:19:22,162
NOT EVEN A THANK-YOU
FOR THE SURGERY?

451
00:19:22,162 --> 00:19:24,030
PLEASE, LISTEN TO REASON,
MY SON.

452
00:19:24,030 --> 00:19:27,400
YOU HAVE BEEN
SENT TO US FOR A PURPOSE.

453
00:19:27,400 --> 00:19:30,070
- THAT IS WHY YOU ARE
ABLE TO PENETRATE--
- HEY!

454
00:19:30,070 --> 00:19:32,638
- THE SECRET WALL
OF ILLUSION.
- OH.

455
00:19:32,638 --> 00:19:35,108
ONLY THE PURE IN SPIRIT

456
00:19:35,108 --> 00:19:37,810
CAN PASS THROUGH.

457
00:19:37,810 --> 00:19:39,412
PURE IN SPIRIT, HUH?

458
00:19:39,412 --> 00:19:42,482
[SERVO MIMICS DRAWL]
WISH I COULD THINK
OF SOMETHING FOR THAT.

459
00:19:42,482 --> 00:19:44,718
BIKE’S IN BAD SHAPE.

460
00:19:46,520 --> 00:19:49,055
WHY DIDN’T YOU
SEE THAT WALL?

461
00:19:52,058 --> 00:19:53,827
HE’S GOT LORI ANDERSON
IN THERE!

462
00:19:53,827 --> 00:19:56,162
I DON’T THINK
YOU FULLY UNDERSTAND--

463
00:19:56,162 --> 00:19:59,498
YOU OWE ME $7.50.

464
00:19:59,498 --> 00:20:01,100
YOU’VE BEEN CHOSEN,

465
00:20:01,100 --> 00:20:04,203
LIKE ARTHUR BEING ABLE TO PULL
EXCALIBUR OUT OF THE ROCK.

466
00:20:04,203 --> 00:20:05,838
OR LIKE IN POWERBALL.

467
00:20:05,838 --> 00:20:08,008
NASTASIA’S FATHER,

468
00:20:08,008 --> 00:20:10,343
- MR. McWAYNE,
- THAT’S WAYNE?

469
00:20:10,343 --> 00:20:13,313
HAS BEEN SENTENCED TO DEATH
BY THE CONGRESS.

470
00:20:13,313 --> 00:20:15,748
THEY PLAN TO
EXECUTE HIM PUBLICLY.

471
00:20:15,748 --> 00:20:18,118
HE MUST BE RESCUED.

472
00:20:18,118 --> 00:20:21,322
UH, WELL, I SUPPOSE
I COULD GET TO IT TUESDAY, OR--

473
00:20:21,322 --> 00:20:24,457
I MAY.

474
00:20:24,457 --> 00:20:27,027
YOU KNOW AND I KNOW,

475
00:20:27,027 --> 00:20:30,063
THOSE PEOPLE ARE BAD NEWS.

476
00:20:30,063 --> 00:20:31,865
INDEED THEY ARE.

477
00:20:31,865 --> 00:20:33,600
AND THIS TYRANNY MUST END.

478
00:20:33,600 --> 00:20:35,235
UH, DAD, THE NEIGHBORS
CAN SEE YOU.

479
00:20:35,235 --> 00:20:38,438
MONSTERS LIKE PROSSOR
MUST BE STOPPED.

480
00:20:38,438 --> 00:20:41,007
AND IF NASTASIA’S FATHER
IS LOST,

481
00:20:41,007 --> 00:20:43,077
I’M AFRAID THE NEW WAY

482
00:20:43,077 --> 00:20:45,612
WILL BE PERMANENTLY DAMAGED.

483
00:20:45,612 --> 00:20:47,080
YOU’RE NOT LISTENING TO ME.

484
00:20:47,080 --> 00:20:49,548
WELL, YOU’RE REALLY
NOT THAT INTERESTING.

485
00:20:49,548 --> 00:20:52,085
THE ONLY DAMAGE
I CARE ABOUT IS THIS BIKE.

486
00:20:52,085 --> 00:20:54,320
AND THE NEW MOVIE
BY LOUIS MALLE.

487
00:20:54,320 --> 00:20:56,590
NOW, GET THIS STRAIGHT.

488
00:20:56,590 --> 00:21:00,227
I AIN’T INTERESTED
IN YOUR LOCAL POLITICS.

489
00:21:00,227 --> 00:21:03,030
SHOW ME THE WAY
TO THE SHANGRI-LA HERE,

490
00:21:03,030 --> 00:21:05,132
AND I’LL BE ON MY WAY.

491
00:21:05,132 --> 00:21:06,867
LISTEN, MY SON--

492
00:21:06,867 --> 00:21:09,703
OKAY, I HATE HIM AS MUCH
AS I POSSIBLY CAN NOW.

493
00:21:09,703 --> 00:21:11,505
"LISTEN, MY SON"?

494
00:21:11,505 --> 00:21:14,140
I AIN’T YOUR SUN.

495
00:21:14,140 --> 00:21:16,610
[SERVO GROWLS]... WAYNE.

496
00:21:16,610 --> 00:21:19,578
OOH, PACKING A PIECE.

497
00:21:19,578 --> 00:21:22,182
WHAT’S A NICE GIRL LIKE YOU
DOING IN A PLACE LIKE THIS, HUH?

498
00:21:22,182 --> 00:21:24,150
- [SERVO HISSES]
- NO, NOW I HATE HIM
EVEN MORE.

499
00:21:24,150 --> 00:21:25,518
--DOESN’T LIKE YOU.

500
00:21:25,518 --> 00:21:27,287
BURNT OUT FROM
ALL THE CONFLICTS.

501
00:21:27,287 --> 00:21:29,823
ONLY INTERESTED
IN SURVIVING.

502
00:21:29,823 --> 00:21:31,958
ALL GUTS AND NO BRAINS.

503
00:21:31,958 --> 00:21:33,160
HEY, THAT’S ME!

504
00:21:33,160 --> 00:21:34,527
NOW, I’M NOT SAYING
THAT I BELIEVE

505
00:21:34,527 --> 00:21:36,330
IN ALL THIS MUMBO-JUMBO.

506
00:21:36,330 --> 00:21:38,232
BUT THE ELDERS SAY

507
00:21:38,232 --> 00:21:40,233
YOU ARE THE ONE.

508
00:21:40,233 --> 00:21:43,337
HERE’S YOUR CHANCE.

509
00:21:43,337 --> 00:21:45,605
- YOU WANT SURVIVAL?
- SURE, WE ALL DO!

510
00:21:45,605 --> 00:21:47,907
YOU GOT IT.

511
00:21:47,907 --> 00:21:51,712
EITHER YOU HELP ME
RESCUE MY FATHER, OR...

512
00:21:51,712 --> 00:21:55,615
I LIKED YOU BETTER BALD.

513
00:21:55,615 --> 00:21:57,850
I HAVE TO RUN
THE HIGH HURDLES?

514
00:22:00,153 --> 00:22:02,622
YOU DIDN’T GET WORK AFTER
THE STAR TREK MOVIE, DID YOU?

515
00:22:02,622 --> 00:22:05,658
OKAY, YOU GOT A DEAL.

516
00:22:05,658 --> 00:22:07,660
I’M ON FIRE.

517
00:22:07,660 --> 00:22:10,130
FOR NOW.

518
00:22:10,130 --> 00:22:11,698
[COMPUTER]
TUBULAR.

519
00:22:11,698 --> 00:22:14,333
[ALL] SHUT UP!

520
00:22:14,333 --> 00:22:16,202
ATOR? TONG?

521
00:22:16,202 --> 00:22:18,505
- OCH VEN HARRIS?
- WHERE THE HELL ARE WE?

522
00:22:18,505 --> 00:22:19,807
IT’S THE ONLY WAY
TO THE CITY

523
00:22:19,807 --> 00:22:23,143
WITHOUT PASSING THROUGH
THE WASTELAND.

524
00:22:23,143 --> 00:22:24,543
WHY ARE WE WEARING
THESE CLOTHES?

525
00:22:24,543 --> 00:22:26,647
- WHINY MAN!
- I TOLD YOU ABOUT
THE COLONISTS.

526
00:22:26,647 --> 00:22:28,148
THE WORKERS IN THE CITY
WEAR THIS.

527
00:22:28,148 --> 00:22:31,183
WE CAN PASS UNNOTICED.

528
00:22:31,183 --> 00:22:33,320
- WHY’RE WE GOING ALONE?
- WHEN ARE WE GONNA EAT?

529
00:22:33,320 --> 00:22:35,888
BECAUSE WE HAVE TO FIND OUT
WHERE THEY’RE HOLDING MY FATHER.

530
00:22:35,888 --> 00:22:38,192
THE CONGRESS OR
THE OMEGA HEADQUARTERS.

531
00:22:38,192 --> 00:22:40,060
NOW, BE CAREFUL.

532
00:22:40,060 --> 00:22:42,362
THESE CAVERNS
ARE TREACHEROUS.

533
00:22:42,362 --> 00:22:45,598
WHY IS IT COLD IN HERE?

534
00:22:45,598 --> 00:22:47,733
YOUR TORCH
IS BIGGER THAN MINE.

535
00:22:47,733 --> 00:22:51,472
I HATE BATS.

536
00:22:51,472 --> 00:22:53,807
HUH?

537
00:22:53,807 --> 00:22:56,477
LISTEN TO THAT-- IS HE WEARING
LEATHER UNDERGARMENTS?

538
00:22:56,477 --> 00:22:58,545
I HATE THAT.

539
00:23:01,415 --> 00:23:03,250
EW.

540
00:23:05,718 --> 00:23:08,522
WILL SOMEONE PUT
THE STYROFOAM DOWN, PLEASE?

541
00:23:11,958 --> 00:23:14,260
HEH. EIGHT LEGS A WEEK.

542
00:23:14,260 --> 00:23:17,930
I LOVE THAT ONE.

543
00:23:17,930 --> 00:23:19,933
HEY, DON’T--
DON’T WANNA STEP ON ’EM.

544
00:23:19,933 --> 00:23:22,835
MIGHT KILL ’EM.

545
00:23:22,835 --> 00:23:25,038
OH, GREAT,
NOW WE GOTTA BUY THAT ONE.

546
00:23:25,038 --> 00:23:27,340
- LOOK OUT.
- JUST KIDDING.

547
00:23:27,340 --> 00:23:30,210
- GOT YOU.
- PETER, NO!

548
00:23:32,045 --> 00:23:34,547
YOU’RE NOT AFRAID
OF SPIDERS, ARE YOU?

549
00:23:34,547 --> 00:23:37,050
NO.

550
00:23:37,050 --> 00:23:39,085
ALLAN HAVEY.

551
00:23:42,522 --> 00:23:45,658
BOY, SQUEAKY
LITTLE GUYS, EH?

552
00:23:45,658 --> 00:23:49,295
CUTE.

553
00:23:49,295 --> 00:23:52,132
WOW, THERE MUST’VE BEEN
FIVE OR SIX SPIDERS BACK THERE.

554
00:23:54,868 --> 00:23:56,837
HEY, HEY,
YOU’RE BURNING MY FACE.

555
00:23:56,837 --> 00:23:58,638
[SNAKE HISSES]

556
00:23:58,638 --> 00:24:01,508
WHAT, IS THE PROP MAN
JIM STAFFORD?

557
00:24:01,508 --> 00:24:04,845
I HOPE YOU’RE NOT
AFRAID OF SNAKES, TOO.

558
00:24:04,845 --> 00:24:06,980
♪ I DON’T LIKE
SPIDERS AND SNAKES ♪

559
00:24:06,980 --> 00:24:08,582
I LOVE THAT ONE.

560
00:24:08,582 --> 00:24:10,217
NO.

561
00:24:10,217 --> 00:24:13,220
I HOPE YOU’RE NOT
AFRAID OF BOREDOM.

562
00:24:13,220 --> 00:24:15,855
HOW ABOUT YOU?

563
00:24:15,855 --> 00:24:17,557
I GOT THROWN IN
WITH THE SPIDERS.

564
00:24:17,557 --> 00:24:19,392
DIDN’T MEAN TO SCARE YA.

565
00:24:33,473 --> 00:24:34,875
[BOTS LAUGH]

566
00:24:34,875 --> 00:24:36,510
THEY’RE CALLED, WHAT?
"SLOT CARS"?

567
00:24:36,510 --> 00:24:38,110
YEAH, OR "SLOTS" FOR SHORT.

568
00:24:38,110 --> 00:24:40,880
I SAW THE NEAT CHASE SCENES
IN TODAY’S EXPERIMENT,

569
00:24:40,880 --> 00:24:43,817
AND I GOT NOSTALGIC FOR
MY OLD SLOT CAR RACE KIT.

570
00:24:43,817 --> 00:24:46,185
SO, I, UH, RETROFITTED
YOU GUYS WITH WHEEL,

571
00:24:46,185 --> 00:24:49,055
AND BINGO! HOT SLOT BOTS.

572
00:24:49,055 --> 00:24:52,058
YOU’RE GONNA BE GOING OVER
300 SCALE MILES PER HOUR.

573
00:24:52,058 --> 00:24:53,327
WOW, IMAGINE!

574
00:24:53,327 --> 00:24:54,995
WELL, WE’LL DO IT, JOEL,
BUT ARE YOU SURE

575
00:24:54,995 --> 00:24:57,963
WE’RE BUILT TO TAKE THE STRESS
OF 300 SCALE MILES PER HOUR?

576
00:24:57,963 --> 00:24:59,765
OH, COME ON, CROW.
HAVE SOME PRIDE, MAN.

577
00:24:59,765 --> 00:25:01,835
WE’RE SLOTS.
WE CRAVE DANGER.

578
00:25:01,835 --> 00:25:03,237
WE DRINK DEEPLY
OF THE DEEP--

579
00:25:03,237 --> 00:25:05,205
- COME ON!
- WOO-HOO!

580
00:25:05,205 --> 00:25:06,873
JOEL, I SEEM TO BE
HAVING A LITTLE PROBLEM--

581
00:25:06,873 --> 00:25:09,042
WATCH OUT FOR
THAT JUMP, CROW!

582
00:25:09,042 --> 00:25:10,377
JUMP? WHOA!

583
00:25:10,377 --> 00:25:12,312
- --GOING BACKWARDS.
- YES, HE MADE IT.

584
00:25:12,312 --> 00:25:13,647
OH-- COME ON, TOM.

585
00:25:13,647 --> 00:25:14,813
NOW, WHAT IS YOUR PROBLEM?

586
00:25:14,813 --> 00:25:16,348
I DON’T KNOW, MAN.
IF I KNEW THAT--

587
00:25:16,348 --> 00:25:17,950
OH, OKAY, TRY IT AGAIN.

588
00:25:17,950 --> 00:25:20,153
WOO-HOO!

589
00:25:20,153 --> 00:25:22,522
HERE COMES THAT
JUMP AGAIN, CROW!

590
00:25:22,522 --> 00:25:24,958
- NO HANDS! WOO-HOO!
- ALL RIGHT!

591
00:25:24,958 --> 00:25:27,727
OH, COME ON, TOM.
YOU’RE LOSING, AND YOU LOOK BAD.

592
00:25:27,727 --> 00:25:29,695
- WOW, TOMMY!
- THIS IS RIDICULOUS!

593
00:25:29,695 --> 00:25:32,232
I FEEL LIKE A MILK CHOC--

594
00:25:32,232 --> 00:25:34,902
HERE COMES THAT JUMP, TOMMY!

595
00:25:34,902 --> 00:25:35,902
OOH! OW! OOH OOH!

596
00:25:35,902 --> 00:25:38,372
OH BROTHER.

597
00:25:38,372 --> 00:25:39,973
- HERE, HERE.
- I SKINNED MY HAT.

598
00:25:39,973 --> 00:25:42,308
- OH, THAT REALLY HURT.
- OH, COME ON.

599
00:25:42,308 --> 00:25:43,910
- OH BROTHER.
- [SERVO SOBS]

600
00:25:43,910 --> 00:25:45,512
JOEL, THIS IS RIDICULOUS.

601
00:25:45,512 --> 00:25:47,280
I COULDN’T BEAT
MARGARET DUMONT.

602
00:25:47,280 --> 00:25:48,748
ON YOUR LEFT, TOMMY!

603
00:25:48,748 --> 00:25:50,417
I DON’T KNOW
WHAT YOUR PROBLEM IS.

604
00:25:50,417 --> 00:25:52,018
- CROW’S DOING FINE.
- I KNOW.

605
00:25:52,018 --> 00:25:54,153
OH. LISTEN, YOU’VE GOT SOME

606
00:25:54,153 --> 00:25:56,522
MAJOR DESIGN PROBLEMS HERE.
I’M SORRY.

607
00:25:56,522 --> 00:25:58,325
BUT I WANNA GO
300 SCALE MILES AN HOUR!

608
00:25:58,325 --> 00:26:00,127
YEAH, COME ON,
BARNEY OLDFIELD.

609
00:26:00,127 --> 00:26:03,397
INTO THE PITS WITH YOU,
LET’S GO.

610
00:26:03,397 --> 00:26:04,730
WHOO.

611
00:26:04,730 --> 00:26:06,498
I WAS ABLE TO
NEGOTIATE THE CHICANE

612
00:26:06,498 --> 00:26:08,335
WITH NO SACRIFICE IN SPEED.

613
00:26:08,335 --> 00:26:09,768
WE’LL BE RIGHT BACK.

614
00:26:09,768 --> 00:26:11,570
[SINGS]

615
00:26:18,912 --> 00:26:20,080
♪ ...ROCKER ARM ASSEMBLY ♪

616
00:26:20,080 --> 00:26:21,615
♪ AND WE DON’T LIKE DIRT ♪

617
00:26:21,615 --> 00:26:22,815
[LOW HORN BLARES]

618
00:26:22,815 --> 00:26:24,317
THAT WAS ME, SORRY.

619
00:26:24,317 --> 00:26:26,452
I’VE GOT A COOL FORT
UP HERE.

620
00:26:29,288 --> 00:26:32,392
- [LOW HORN BLARES]
- ME AGAIN. SORRY.

621
00:26:32,392 --> 00:26:34,893
HEY, WAIT A MINUTE.
WHAT’S THIS?

622
00:26:34,893 --> 00:26:37,397
THE CLUB UTOPIA.

623
00:26:37,397 --> 00:26:40,700
MAN, THESE ARE
THE NOSEBLEED SEATS.

624
00:26:40,700 --> 00:26:43,503
LOOKS LIKE A DURAN DURAN
VIDEO DOWN THERE.

625
00:26:43,503 --> 00:26:45,672
LOOKS LIKE A HELL
OF A PARTY DOWN THERE.

626
00:26:45,672 --> 00:26:47,673
- IT’S NO PARTY.
- IT’S NO DISCO.

627
00:26:47,673 --> 00:26:50,577
IT’S PART OF THE PACIFICATION
OF THE COLORS.

628
00:26:52,045 --> 00:26:53,713
ARE WE PLANNING
ON JOINING THEM?

629
00:26:53,713 --> 00:26:55,315
WHY, ARE THEY FALLING APART?

630
00:26:55,315 --> 00:26:57,283
NOW, REMEMBER.

631
00:26:57,283 --> 00:26:59,285
NO MATTER WHERE WE ARE,

632
00:26:59,285 --> 00:27:00,753
NO MATTER WHAT HAPPENS,

633
00:27:00,753 --> 00:27:03,523
- SHOW NO EMOTION.
- OH, HE CAN DO THAT.

634
00:27:03,523 --> 00:27:05,692
OR THEY’LL KNOW
WE ARE OUTSIDERS.

635
00:27:05,692 --> 00:27:07,160
GET IT?

636
00:27:08,395 --> 00:27:10,997
- YEAH, I GET IT.
- TOOK ME A SECOND.

637
00:27:10,997 --> 00:27:12,632
I KNOW THE BOUNCER HERE.

638
00:27:12,632 --> 00:27:15,368
HE’LL, LIKE,
TOTALLY LET US IN.

639
00:27:15,368 --> 00:27:18,037
HEY, UH, YOU SPEND
A LOT OF TIME HERE?

640
00:27:18,037 --> 00:27:20,873
LOOK, YOU ALREADY MET HER.
YOU DON’T NEED A LINE.

641
00:27:24,177 --> 00:27:25,812
WEDNESDAY IS NAZI NIGHT.

642
00:27:25,812 --> 00:27:29,482
GERMANS DRINK FREE.

643
00:27:29,482 --> 00:27:30,817
WHA-- HUH?

644
00:27:30,817 --> 00:27:33,820
- COOL.
- ACHTUNG, BABY!

645
00:27:33,820 --> 00:27:35,255
MEIN KAMPF!

646
00:27:35,255 --> 00:27:36,957
--TO ENJOY...

647
00:27:36,957 --> 00:27:40,160
THE VIDEO-VISCERAL PROCESS.

648
00:27:40,160 --> 00:27:42,295
I’M THE GUY WITH
A SNAKE ON MY FACE.

649
00:27:42,295 --> 00:27:44,630
--AND ENJOY
THE ENTERTAINMENT.

650
00:27:44,630 --> 00:27:46,733
WHAT DO YOU
WANNA DO TONIGHT, MARTY?

651
00:27:46,733 --> 00:27:49,368
I DON’T KNOW--
WHAT DO YOU WANNA DO?

652
00:27:52,338 --> 00:27:55,875
AH, ACTION. I SAID ACTION!

653
00:27:55,875 --> 00:27:58,177
[SERVO AS BARRY WHITE]
OH BABY, I LOVE
TO WHIP YOU, BABY.

654
00:27:58,177 --> 00:27:59,912
--HOPE YOU ENJOY

655
00:27:59,912 --> 00:28:03,750
THE VIDEO-VISCERAL PROCESS.

656
00:28:03,750 --> 00:28:06,118
RELAX AND ENJOY

657
00:28:06,118 --> 00:28:08,220
THE ENTERTAINMENT PROVIDED.

658
00:28:08,220 --> 00:28:10,190
IF YOU DO NOT ENJOY IT,

659
00:28:10,190 --> 00:28:12,958
YOU MAY RETURN
THE UNUSED PORTION.

660
00:28:12,958 --> 00:28:14,927
- EVERY COUGH SYRUP.
- [SERVO WHISPERS] COUGH SYRUP.

661
00:28:14,927 --> 00:28:16,295
- MOUTHWASH.
- MOUTHWASH.

662
00:28:16,295 --> 00:28:17,697
- DECONGESTANT.
- DECONGESTANT.

663
00:28:17,697 --> 00:28:18,932
- THAT YOU DRINK.
- DRINK.

664
00:28:18,932 --> 00:28:21,500
- IS RED OR GREEN.
- RED, GREEN, YEAH.

665
00:28:21,500 --> 00:28:23,302
- REMEMBER MY BREATH?
- MM-HMM.

666
00:28:23,302 --> 00:28:25,805
- REMEMBER HOW IT USED TO BE?
- OH, IT STUNK.

667
00:28:25,805 --> 00:28:27,640
- I MEAN, PEW.
- P-U.

668
00:28:27,640 --> 00:28:29,108
- AND THE DRY,
- DRY.

669
00:28:29,108 --> 00:28:30,243
- HACKING--
- HACKING.

670
00:28:30,243 --> 00:28:31,577
- COUGH.
- COUGH.

671
00:28:31,577 --> 00:28:33,647
- LITTLE GLOBULES.
- THEY WERE GREEN, WEREN’T THEY?

672
00:28:33,647 --> 00:28:35,948
- GREEN AND BROWN.
- AND THEY STUCK TO YA.

673
00:28:35,948 --> 00:28:37,583
- WELL, NO MORE.
- NUH-UH.

674
00:28:37,583 --> 00:28:38,852
- NOT WITH MY--
- MM.

675
00:28:38,852 --> 00:28:39,985
- SCOPE.
- SCOPE.

676
00:28:39,985 --> 00:28:41,855
- AND MY...
- YES?

677
00:28:41,855 --> 00:28:43,790
- ROBITUSSIN.
- OH, YES.

678
00:28:46,458 --> 00:28:49,695
SHE’S UNCOILING.

679
00:28:49,695 --> 00:28:51,030
THE HUMAN BODY IS NEAT.

680
00:28:51,030 --> 00:28:53,633
MM-HMM.

681
00:28:53,633 --> 00:28:55,235
THIS IS LIKE
A REALLY WEIRD PRODUCTION

682
00:28:55,235 --> 00:28:57,503
OF THE BACCHAE.

683
00:28:57,503 --> 00:29:00,072
IF YOU CAN’T
PUT IN 30 MINUTES A DAY,

684
00:29:00,072 --> 00:29:01,808
YOU DON’T DESERVE
A HOT DATE.

685
00:29:01,808 --> 00:29:03,710
U.S. SWIM IN SICKNESS.

686
00:29:05,812 --> 00:29:08,280
OH, THEY’RE GOOD
TONIGHT, HUH?

687
00:29:08,280 --> 00:29:11,317
OH, AN ALL-AGES SHOW?
THIS IS WHERE I DRAW THE LINE.

688
00:29:14,053 --> 00:29:15,288
WELL, UH,
IT’S AMATEUR NIGHT.

689
00:29:15,288 --> 00:29:18,692
I’M GONNA GO DO SOME TIME.

690
00:29:18,692 --> 00:29:21,460
♪ WAKA-CHICKA
WAKA-CHICKA... ♪

691
00:29:21,460 --> 00:29:24,663
UM, EARTH TO
PAPER CHASE GUY.

692
00:29:31,703 --> 00:29:35,575
CAN YOU WORK FOR ME TOMORROW?
I GOT THIS THING.

693
00:29:35,575 --> 00:29:36,943
YOU KNOW,
THEY ALL LOOK SO GOOD

694
00:29:36,943 --> 00:29:39,312
I WOULDN’T EVEN KNOW
WHERE TO BEGIN.

695
00:29:42,448 --> 00:29:44,617
- WHOA.
- BAD.

696
00:29:47,020 --> 00:29:49,088
WELL, HEY, WE’RE GONNA
SLOW IT DOWN A BIT NOW.

697
00:29:49,088 --> 00:29:51,790
PERHAPS YOU COULD LOOSEN
A COUPLE OF STRAPS.

698
00:29:51,790 --> 00:29:53,693
YEAH, MAYBE ENJOY
A FEW LIGHT LASHES

699
00:29:53,693 --> 00:29:56,930
AND CARRY EACH OTHER AROUND.
THERE, THAT’S GOOD.

700
00:29:56,930 --> 00:29:58,598
THOUGHT MORE PEOPLE WERE
GONNA SHOW UP TONIGHT.

701
00:29:58,598 --> 00:30:00,267
DON’T KNOW WHAT HAPPENED.

702
00:30:00,267 --> 00:30:02,035
UH, BUT I’M NOT DONE YET.

703
00:30:02,035 --> 00:30:05,003
I-- OH.

704
00:30:05,003 --> 00:30:06,505
BOY, THEY’RE REALLY GOOD
TONIGHT, HUH?

705
00:30:06,505 --> 00:30:08,040
HEY, THE GIMLETS--
GREAT, BY THE WAY.

706
00:30:08,040 --> 00:30:09,375
ENJOY THOSE DRINKS.

707
00:30:09,375 --> 00:30:13,012
- ’KAY, BYE-BYE.
- OOH, LEATHER.

708
00:30:13,012 --> 00:30:15,080
SEEMS KIND OF LIKE A LEATHER

709
00:30:15,080 --> 00:30:16,850
BUSBY BERKELEY DOWN THERE.

710
00:30:16,850 --> 00:30:19,118
MM-HMM.

711
00:30:19,118 --> 00:30:20,987
♪ WELL, YOU SWING
YOUR PARTNER WITH A CHAIN ♪

712
00:30:20,987 --> 00:30:22,522
♪ ’CAUSE LOVE IS BEST
WHEN THERE’S SWEET PAIN ♪

713
00:30:22,522 --> 00:30:24,323
- OH...
- DOSEY-DOE.

714
00:30:24,323 --> 00:30:25,825
I LIKED IT.

715
00:30:25,825 --> 00:30:27,927
- ...TO EVERYONE’S FREEDOM.
- WELL, I SUPPOSE YOU COULD--

716
00:30:27,927 --> 00:30:30,697
- WORK MUST BE
NEAT AND EFFICIENT.
- WELL, OF COURSE, BUT--

717
00:30:30,697 --> 00:30:33,833
- FOOD AND ENTERTAINMENT
ARE PROVIDED.
- WHY, THANK YOU--

718
00:30:33,833 --> 00:30:35,635
SILENCE IS ITS OWN REWARD.

719
00:30:35,635 --> 00:30:38,203
OH, THE FUTURE’S
SO REASONABLE.

720
00:30:38,203 --> 00:30:39,505
...OBLIGATIONS.

721
00:30:39,505 --> 00:30:41,908
WE ARE VERY WELL
TODAY, THANK YOU.

722
00:30:41,908 --> 00:30:44,810
YOU’RE WELCOME.

723
00:30:44,810 --> 00:30:47,180
WORK IS EVERYONE’S FREEDOM.

724
00:30:47,180 --> 00:30:48,948
SECOND, FIRST,
SAME AS THE FIRST.

725
00:30:48,948 --> 00:30:51,117
NEAT AND EFFICIENT.

726
00:30:51,117 --> 00:30:53,318
FOOD AND ENTERTAINMENT
ARE PROVIDED.

727
00:30:53,318 --> 00:30:55,922
- UH-HUH.
- SILENCE IS ITS OWN REWARD.

728
00:30:55,922 --> 00:30:57,390
WHAT? OH.

729
00:30:57,390 --> 00:31:00,693
OBEY THE LAWS
AND OBLIGATIONS.

730
00:31:00,693 --> 00:31:03,262
WE ARE VERY WELL
TODAY, THANK YOU.

731
00:31:03,262 --> 00:31:04,563
YOU’RE WELCOME.

732
00:31:04,563 --> 00:31:06,298
WE’D LIKE TO WELCOME
THE GUY FROM PAPER CHASE

733
00:31:06,298 --> 00:31:07,933
HERE, TODAY.

734
00:31:11,003 --> 00:31:13,172
WOW, LOOKS LIKE
THE LAND O’LAKES DAIRY

735
00:31:13,172 --> 00:31:14,707
SURVIVED THE APOCALYPSE.

736
00:31:18,778 --> 00:31:21,313
OH, YOU’RE HERE.

737
00:31:21,313 --> 00:31:22,948
SO, UH...

738
00:31:22,948 --> 00:31:24,383
WHAT DO THEY MAKE HERE?

739
00:31:24,383 --> 00:31:26,885
I DON’T KNOW, BUT THEY SURE
SEEM TO MAKE A LOT OF IT.

740
00:31:26,885 --> 00:31:29,455
[BOTS] HMM.

741
00:31:29,455 --> 00:31:31,690
OVER HERE IS WHERE
WE HAVE THE CONDENSER.

742
00:31:31,690 --> 00:31:34,593
AND THESE ARE
THE CURDING TANKS.

743
00:31:37,730 --> 00:31:39,865
WE DISCOVERED A WEAK LINK
THAT ENABLES US

744
00:31:39,865 --> 00:31:41,300
TO TAP INTO THEIR
COMPUTER SYSTEM.

745
00:31:41,300 --> 00:31:42,735
LISTEN, LADY, I DON’T
NEED ANY COMPUTER

746
00:31:42,735 --> 00:31:44,270
TO TELL ME I’M
IN WAY OVER MY HEAD.

747
00:31:44,270 --> 00:31:45,872
YOU UNDERSTAND? LOOK AT ME!

748
00:31:45,872 --> 00:31:47,640
OH, HE’S SO
CLEARLY MOTIVATED.

749
00:31:47,640 --> 00:31:50,377
DID YOU SEE
THE FIREPOWER OUT THERE?

750
00:31:50,377 --> 00:31:51,610
DO YOU KNOW WHAT
WE’RE UP AGAINST HERE?

751
00:31:51,610 --> 00:31:52,778
I NEED A McWAYNE WITH FRIES!

752
00:31:52,778 --> 00:31:54,380
I DON’T LIKE THE ODDS HERE,

753
00:31:54,380 --> 00:31:56,015
SO I’M GETTING OUT,
ALL RIGHT?

754
00:31:56,015 --> 00:31:58,618
THE HELL?

755
00:31:58,618 --> 00:32:00,387
THE DEAL’S OFF.

756
00:32:00,387 --> 00:32:03,188
THERE’S NOTHING MORE
I CAN DO FOR YOU.

757
00:32:03,188 --> 00:32:04,423
SHE LOOKS LIKE DONDI.

758
00:32:04,423 --> 00:32:06,993
YOU’VE GOT TO HELP ME NOW.

759
00:32:06,993 --> 00:32:10,330
I DON’T HAVE TO DO ANYTHING.

760
00:32:10,330 --> 00:32:11,630
YOU GAVE ME YOUR WORD.

761
00:32:11,630 --> 00:32:14,100
AND YOUR CLASS RING,
AND YOU PINNED ME.

762
00:32:14,100 --> 00:32:16,868
D’UH... I DID?

763
00:32:19,072 --> 00:32:22,442
I CAN’T STAY MAD AT YOU.

764
00:32:22,442 --> 00:32:24,777
YOU KNOW, WHEN YOU’RE MAKING
A LOW-BUDGET SCI-FI MOVIE,

765
00:32:24,777 --> 00:32:26,578
YOU CAN FILM IT
ALMOST ANYWHERE.

766
00:32:26,578 --> 00:32:27,980
YEAH, LAND O’LAKES PLANT.

767
00:32:27,980 --> 00:32:29,248
DESERTED CARPET WAREHOUSE.

768
00:32:29,248 --> 00:32:30,550
YEAH, SOME FIELD IN OHIO.

769
00:32:30,550 --> 00:32:33,653
- AN OLD QUARRY.
- YEAH.

770
00:32:33,653 --> 00:32:35,922
HEY, UH, WEREN’T WE SUPPOSED
TO DO A SCENE IN THERE?

771
00:32:40,960 --> 00:32:42,528
[CROW MOANS]

772
00:32:42,528 --> 00:32:44,797
NOW THEY’RE IN A PARKING RAMP.
CASE IN POINT.

773
00:32:44,797 --> 00:32:47,400
YEAH, OR THEY’RE
IN A 1960’S METHODIST CHURCH

774
00:32:47,400 --> 00:32:48,835
THAT’S UNDER CONSTRUCTION.

775
00:32:48,835 --> 00:32:52,072
HUH?

776
00:32:52,072 --> 00:32:55,475
OH, NOW THEY’RE
IN CABRINI-GREEN.

777
00:32:55,475 --> 00:32:57,177
MAYOR BYRNE?
YOU IN HERE?

778
00:32:57,177 --> 00:32:59,145
SECRETARY CAMP?

779
00:33:01,313 --> 00:33:03,548
MORE INEFFECTIVE
AUTHORITARIANS ON THE WAY.

780
00:33:05,585 --> 00:33:07,053
VLEV-EE-VLA?

781
00:33:07,053 --> 00:33:09,388
- VDLWAW! VDLWAW!
- OH.

782
00:33:10,757 --> 00:33:12,625
♪ THERE WERE
DENTAL HYGIENISTS ♪

783
00:33:12,625 --> 00:33:14,393
♪ TWO BY TWO ♪

784
00:33:16,962 --> 00:33:18,998
THE NO-FRILLS
STATE CAPITOL TOUR.

785
00:33:21,600 --> 00:33:25,438
UH, THINK I’LL JUST
SNEAK IN HERE. THERE.

786
00:33:25,438 --> 00:33:28,107
♪ VIDEO KILLED
THE RADIO STAR ♪

787
00:33:29,775 --> 00:33:31,877
IT’S THE FORBIN PROJECT!

788
00:33:33,947 --> 00:33:36,348
HAD GEORGE BUSH
BEEN RE-ELECTED.

789
00:33:39,985 --> 00:33:42,722
OH, SEE, NOW THEY’RE USING
A MOTEL 6 FOR THIS SHOT.

790
00:33:42,722 --> 00:33:44,857
- SEE?
- HMM.

791
00:33:44,857 --> 00:33:47,527
BOY, IBM SINCE THEY CUT
THE STAFF. WHOO.

792
00:33:49,128 --> 00:33:51,397
HEY, CHARLIE, I CAN SEE
YOUR HOUSE FROM UP HERE.

793
00:33:51,397 --> 00:33:53,665
- YOU SAY THAT
EVERY DAY, BOB.
- I KNOW.

794
00:33:56,402 --> 00:33:58,670
♪ CHIM-CHIMINEY
CHIM-CHIMINEY ♪

795
00:33:58,670 --> 00:34:00,973
♪ CHIM-CHIM CHEREE ♪

796
00:34:02,975 --> 00:34:04,910
GOD, I WISH I HAD A JOB
LIKE THOSE GUYS.

797
00:34:04,910 --> 00:34:06,945
BET THAT PAYS WELL.

798
00:34:10,817 --> 00:34:13,552
OH, I JUST CAN’T DECIDE
WHO TO SHOOT.

799
00:34:15,555 --> 00:34:17,923
OH, THIS LOOKS LIKE
THE CHICAGO CIRCLE CAMPUS.

800
00:34:17,923 --> 00:34:19,892
YEP.

801
00:34:19,892 --> 00:34:21,993
THIS IS STARTING
TO LOOK MORE AND MORE

802
00:34:21,993 --> 00:34:24,630
LIKE AN OBSESSION AD.

803
00:34:24,630 --> 00:34:27,167
ARE THOSE SUPER-SOAKERS?

804
00:34:27,167 --> 00:34:29,868
OH, LIKE,
I’M SO GLAD I CAME.

805
00:34:29,868 --> 00:34:33,505
[SERVO MUMBLES]

806
00:34:46,352 --> 00:34:48,487
DEARLY BELOVED,
WE ARE GATHERED HERE TODAY

807
00:34:48,487 --> 00:34:50,590
TO GET THROUGH
THIS THING CALLED LIFE.

808
00:34:50,590 --> 00:34:52,125
IS THAT YOUR DAD?

809
00:34:56,228 --> 00:34:57,930
UH, TAKE YOUR SEAT, MA’AM.

810
00:34:57,930 --> 00:35:01,433
HON, BE CAREFUL
OF THE GUN BEHIND YOU.

811
00:35:01,433 --> 00:35:02,668
OOH.

812
00:35:02,668 --> 00:35:05,403
WHOA, ANOTHER QUICK
MOOD SWING FROM OUR HERO.

813
00:35:05,403 --> 00:35:08,507
JEEZ.

814
00:35:08,507 --> 00:35:10,175
HEY, WE’RE DOING
A SHOW HERE.

815
00:35:10,175 --> 00:35:12,445
DO YOU MIND?

816
00:35:21,053 --> 00:35:23,355
JIMMY CARTER--
MISSING IN ACTION.

817
00:35:23,355 --> 00:35:25,725
[SERVO CHUCKLES]

818
00:35:25,725 --> 00:35:26,992
HEY, IF YOU DIDN’T
LIKE THE SHOW,

819
00:35:26,992 --> 00:35:28,962
THERE’S A COMMENT BOX
IN FRONT OF THE...

820
00:35:31,863 --> 00:35:33,265
UGH-- OH, OH,
I DON’T WANNA HURT MYSELF.

821
00:35:33,265 --> 00:35:35,702
FALL GENTLY, THERE.

822
00:35:35,702 --> 00:35:37,937
MOD SQUAD:
THE NEXT GENERATION.

823
00:35:37,937 --> 00:35:41,073
♪ WAKA-CHICKA
WAKA-CHICKA... ♪

824
00:35:41,073 --> 00:35:42,408
HEY, COME ON, LIE DOWN.

825
00:35:42,408 --> 00:35:44,710
YOU WERE KILLED
SIX TIMES ALREADY.

826
00:35:48,513 --> 00:35:51,217
WHOA, THAT WAS DUMB!
CAN’T BELIEVE WE DID THAT.

827
00:35:51,217 --> 00:35:52,852
GET DOWN! RECOVER!

828
00:35:52,852 --> 00:35:54,920
COME ON, ANGELS,
BOSLEY’S WAITING!

829
00:35:54,920 --> 00:35:57,290
GET DOWN! COME ON.

830
00:35:57,290 --> 00:35:58,657
THIS IS TURNING OUT
TO BE MORE

831
00:35:58,657 --> 00:35:59,825
THAN I BARGAINED FOR, LADY.

832
00:35:59,825 --> 00:36:03,395
OH, WHAT HAVE YOU LIKED
ON THIS TRIP?

833
00:36:03,395 --> 00:36:04,897
JIMMY CARTER? YEAH,

834
00:36:04,897 --> 00:36:06,398
- BUT ALSO RONNY COX.
- ARE YOU ALL RIGHT?

835
00:36:06,398 --> 00:36:08,000
NO MATTER WHAT HAPPENS,

836
00:36:08,000 --> 00:36:09,468
I’M GLAD I’M
WITH YOU, FATHER.

837
00:36:09,468 --> 00:36:12,272
OR RUTGER HAUER
OR TIMOTHY LEARY.

838
00:36:13,538 --> 00:36:15,842
WE’RE WASTING TIME.

839
00:36:15,842 --> 00:36:17,743
DING! DING!

840
00:36:17,743 --> 00:36:20,947
OH, HE’S GOING FOR
THE PLUSH BANANA, YES!

841
00:36:20,947 --> 00:36:23,815
HERE ARE TWO UNSUCCESSFUL
INSURANCE SALESMEN.

842
00:36:23,815 --> 00:36:25,483
JERRY MAHONEY!
KNUCKLEHEAD SMITH!

843
00:36:25,483 --> 00:36:27,152
OH, THE VENTRILOQUY!

844
00:36:27,152 --> 00:36:29,288
COME ON.

845
00:36:29,288 --> 00:36:31,657
JIMMY CARTER IS
THE ENFORCER.

846
00:36:33,558 --> 00:36:35,360
[SERVO AS CARTER]
FEEL SOME MALAISE, SUCKER.

847
00:36:42,200 --> 00:36:43,502
HEY, GOOD CONTINUITY.

848
00:36:43,502 --> 00:36:44,703
WE’VE SEEN
THIS PLACE BEFORE.

849
00:36:44,703 --> 00:36:46,072
- YEAH.
- HMM.

850
00:36:50,208 --> 00:36:51,877
YOUR UNIVERSITY
OF SOUTHERN CALIFORNIA

851
00:36:51,877 --> 00:36:53,913
- TROJANS!
- [SERVO MIMICS DRUMLINE]

852
00:36:53,913 --> 00:36:55,247
COME ON! MOVE IT!

853
00:36:55,247 --> 00:36:57,215
UH, NOT YOU, THOUGH.

854
00:36:57,215 --> 00:36:58,717
OR YOU.

855
00:37:03,255 --> 00:37:05,323
[PEOPLE SCREAM]

856
00:37:05,323 --> 00:37:08,160
HEY, SOMEBODY LEFT A CHOPPER
WITH THE KEYS IN IT!

857
00:37:08,160 --> 00:37:09,428
COME ON!

858
00:37:09,428 --> 00:37:12,865
NOW, OF COURSE,
HE’S CERTIFIED FOR HELICOPTERS.

859
00:37:12,865 --> 00:37:16,035
- AIRWOLF!
- [SERVO HUMS TV THEME]

860
00:37:16,035 --> 00:37:18,503
IS THAT THE MUSIC
TO AIRWOLF?

861
00:37:22,575 --> 00:37:25,377
LET’S GO, PROFESSOR!

862
00:37:25,377 --> 00:37:26,745
[SOLDIERS SCREAM]

863
00:37:26,745 --> 00:37:28,447
[CROW AS CARTER]
NICE SHOOTIN’, AMY.

864
00:37:28,447 --> 00:37:31,617
- LET’S GO!
- OH-- ALL RIGHT.

865
00:37:31,617 --> 00:37:33,518
- COME ON!
- GET IN.

866
00:37:33,518 --> 00:37:35,822
WE HAVE RESERVATIONS
FOR 8:30!

867
00:37:35,822 --> 00:37:38,423
COME ON! HURRY UP, COME ON!

868
00:37:38,423 --> 00:37:40,793
THEY’RE COMING, NASTASIA!

869
00:37:40,793 --> 00:37:42,928
AAH!

870
00:37:42,928 --> 00:37:46,798
OKAY, WE’LL JUST
MEET YOU THERE, THEN.

871
00:37:46,798 --> 00:37:48,700
UH, COULD YOU
TOUCH DOWN JUST, BACK--

872
00:37:48,700 --> 00:37:51,103
JUST FOR A SECOND, PLEASE?
PICK UP AMY?

873
00:37:55,675 --> 00:37:57,410
THEY DIDN’T EVE
HAVE A DOE PERMIT.

874
00:37:57,410 --> 00:37:58,910
SAD.

875
00:38:01,347 --> 00:38:03,948
THANKS A LOT, JERKS.

876
00:38:06,718 --> 00:38:09,288
OH, HEH HEH,
♪ GIVE PEACE A CHANCE ♪

877
00:38:09,288 --> 00:38:11,957
SHE’S BEEN HIT!
WE’VE GOT TO BACK.

878
00:38:11,957 --> 00:38:13,292
NO WAY.

879
00:38:13,292 --> 00:38:14,927
WE’RE LUCKY WE GOT
OUT OF THERE ALIVE.

880
00:38:14,927 --> 00:38:16,262
I’M NOT GOING BACK IN.

881
00:38:16,262 --> 00:38:17,597
WOULDN’T A HERO GO BACK IN?

882
00:38:17,597 --> 00:38:19,798
WELL, SOME HEROES.
HE’S JUST NOT THAT KIND OF HERO.

883
00:38:19,798 --> 00:38:21,067
[BOTS] OH.

884
00:38:21,067 --> 00:38:23,402
SHE’S MY DAUGHTER.

885
00:38:23,402 --> 00:38:25,170
OKAY, THEN YOU GO BACK IN.

886
00:38:25,170 --> 00:38:27,072
SORRY, PROFESSOR.

887
00:38:27,072 --> 00:38:29,075
MY DEAL WAS TO GET YOU OUT.

888
00:38:29,075 --> 00:38:30,710
MR. LOOPHOLE.

889
00:38:30,710 --> 00:38:32,545
- AND THAT’S IT.
- WELL, IF I...

890
00:38:32,545 --> 00:38:35,313
GO BACK FOR HER, I’LL HAVE
TO GO BACK FOR EVERYBODY.

891
00:38:35,313 --> 00:38:37,148
NOW LET’S SEE
WHAT THIS BABY CAN DO.

892
00:38:37,148 --> 00:38:38,817
THIS BABY CAN SET
RIGHT BACK DOWN

893
00:38:38,817 --> 00:38:42,287
AND PICK UP HIS DAUGHTER.

894
00:38:42,287 --> 00:38:46,158
[ALL HUM
"RIDE OF THE VALKYRIES"]

895
00:38:46,158 --> 00:38:49,162
♪ KILL THE WABBIT... ♪

896
00:38:49,162 --> 00:38:52,097
DAMN LOGO’S
IN THE WAY, AGAIN.

897
00:38:52,097 --> 00:38:54,467
HE’S THE MASTER
OF THE PAN-FLUTE.

898
00:38:57,437 --> 00:38:59,672
THAT’S FOR NANA MOUSKOURI!

899
00:38:59,672 --> 00:39:01,540
WE GOT SOME COMPANY THERE,
PROFESSOR.

900
00:39:01,540 --> 00:39:03,475
OH, HOW NICE
THAT WE HAVE VISITORS,

901
00:39:03,475 --> 00:39:04,977
BUT THEY’RE SO RUDE.

902
00:39:07,713 --> 00:39:09,948
YOU ANY GOOD
WITH THAT THING?

903
00:39:09,948 --> 00:39:12,117
HUH? WHAT? OH!

904
00:39:12,117 --> 00:39:13,885
OH, THIS OLD THING?

905
00:39:20,927 --> 00:39:24,730
I LIKE SANTA.

906
00:39:24,730 --> 00:39:26,165
WELL, WHEN IN ROME.

907
00:39:26,165 --> 00:39:27,767
EAT LEAD.

908
00:39:33,505 --> 00:39:35,107
OOH.

909
00:39:38,343 --> 00:39:41,447
YOU SHOULD’VE DONE THAT
WITH STAGFLATION.

910
00:39:41,447 --> 00:39:43,348
NICE SHOT, PROFESSOR.

911
00:39:43,348 --> 00:39:46,685
NEXT STOP, SHANGRI-LA.

912
00:39:46,685 --> 00:39:49,988
- BRAD.
- EARL.

913
00:39:49,988 --> 00:39:52,792
WE DON’T CARE ONE LITTLE BIT

914
00:39:52,792 --> 00:39:54,727
ABOUT YOU AND YOUR SO-CALLED

915
00:39:54,727 --> 00:39:56,462
ENLIGHTENED ELDERS.

916
00:39:56,462 --> 00:39:58,430
HOWEVER, WE WILL
CHECK YOUR REFERENCES.

917
00:39:58,430 --> 00:40:02,033
THE REAL WORLD IS RUN
BY MEN OF POWER.

918
00:40:02,033 --> 00:40:04,203
NOW, SELL ME THIS PENCIL.

919
00:40:06,505 --> 00:40:08,173
OH, HE’S JUST
A RECEPTIONIST.

920
00:40:08,173 --> 00:40:11,610
WHEN THE SYSTEM
IS RUNNING EFFICIENTLY--

921
00:40:11,610 --> 00:40:13,812
THOSE GUARDS GET,
LIKE, $5.75 AN HOUR.

922
00:40:13,812 --> 00:40:15,347
WE HATE CHANGE!

923
00:40:15,347 --> 00:40:16,848
MR. PLEASENCE.

924
00:40:16,848 --> 00:40:18,450
--ARE DISRUPTIVE.

925
00:40:18,450 --> 00:40:20,318
AND MUST NOT BE TOLERATED.

926
00:40:20,318 --> 00:40:22,320
IS THAT A STAT MACHINE?

927
00:40:22,320 --> 00:40:25,257
YOUR FATHER WANTS
TO CHANGE OUR LAWS...

928
00:40:25,257 --> 00:40:28,293
AND OUR OBLIGATIONS.

929
00:40:28,293 --> 00:40:31,497
AND, I ASSURE YOU,

930
00:40:31,497 --> 00:40:34,833
IT WILL NOT BE TOLERATED.

931
00:40:34,833 --> 00:40:38,337
- YOU ONLY LIVE ONCE.
- I CAN ASSURE YOU, PROSSOR,

932
00:40:38,337 --> 00:40:40,538
YOU...

933
00:40:40,538 --> 00:40:43,042
AND YOUR CRIPPLED SOCIETY

934
00:40:43,042 --> 00:40:44,377
ARE DOOMED.

935
00:40:44,377 --> 00:40:47,412
IT’S A DIFFERENTLY-ABLED
SOCIETY.

936
00:40:47,412 --> 00:40:50,148
TELL ME I’M A BAD BOY.

937
00:40:50,148 --> 00:40:51,583
YOU’D LOOK GREAT BALD.

938
00:40:51,583 --> 00:40:53,852
I’M GOING TO TEACH
THE PROFESSOR

939
00:40:53,852 --> 00:40:56,155
A LESSON...

940
00:40:56,155 --> 00:40:59,123
HE WILL NEVER FORGET.

941
00:40:59,123 --> 00:41:01,993
I’M GOING TO DESTROY
SOMETHING...

942
00:41:01,993 --> 00:41:04,563
HE LOVES EVEN MORE THAN

943
00:41:04,563 --> 00:41:06,332
HIS PRECIOUS NEW WAY.

944
00:41:06,332 --> 00:41:08,467
- HIS BELL COLLECTION?
- I AM GOING

945
00:41:08,467 --> 00:41:11,470
TO DESTROY YOU.

946
00:41:13,372 --> 00:41:15,273
- EW.
- YUCK.

947
00:41:15,273 --> 00:41:18,210
AND I JUST ATE
A SNICKERS, TOO.

948
00:41:23,548 --> 00:41:25,017
YOU JUST SPIT ON ME--

949
00:41:25,017 --> 00:41:28,120
I DON’T BELIEVE THIS.

950
00:41:28,120 --> 00:41:31,457
[ALL] BOO.

951
00:41:31,457 --> 00:41:33,058
HATE THAT.

952
00:41:33,058 --> 00:41:35,327
UH, THE INTERVIEW’S
NOT GOING WELL.

953
00:41:37,262 --> 00:41:39,163
WHY DON’T WE JUST
START OVER?

954
00:41:42,200 --> 00:41:43,735
TAKE HER AWAY.

955
00:41:43,735 --> 00:41:45,670
BRING ME A MOIST TOWELETTE.

956
00:41:45,670 --> 00:41:47,673
PREPARE HER

957
00:41:47,673 --> 00:41:49,742
FOR THE ASSEMBLY LINE.

958
00:41:49,742 --> 00:41:51,443
- [NASTASIA SCREAMS]
- OH, THEY’RE GONNA MAKE HER

959
00:41:51,443 --> 00:41:54,145
WORK LIGHT INDUSTRIAL
FOR TEMPS, NOW.

960
00:41:54,145 --> 00:41:56,715
OH, MAN! JEEZ.

961
00:41:56,715 --> 00:41:58,283
HEY, I GOT AN IDEA.

962
00:41:58,283 --> 00:41:59,585
WHY DON’T WE GO BACK
TO THE SATELLITE AND...

963
00:41:59,585 --> 00:42:01,187
- [SERVO WHISPERS]
- HUH? AHH!

964
00:42:01,187 --> 00:42:03,555
THEN WE COULD... [WHISPERS]

965
00:42:11,097 --> 00:42:13,132
♪♪

966
00:42:13,132 --> 00:42:14,967
HEY, WE ARE BACK, NOW.

967
00:42:14,967 --> 00:42:17,035
HEY, ABOUT THAT
WARRIOR OF THE LOST WORLD,

968
00:42:17,035 --> 00:42:19,538
HUH?

969
00:42:19,538 --> 00:42:21,507
YOU KNOW, IT’S FUNNY.
HE’S RIDING AROUND

970
00:42:21,507 --> 00:42:24,443
IN THE APOCALYPSE
ON A TALKING MOTORCYCLE

971
00:42:24,443 --> 00:42:26,545
HE’S DOING BATTLE WITH
IMPERIAL STORM-TROOPERS,

972
00:42:26,545 --> 00:42:29,982
NINJAS AND NAZIS
AND THE LIKE.

973
00:42:29,982 --> 00:42:31,517
BUT WE WONDERED
WHAT IT WOULD BE LIKE

974
00:42:31,517 --> 00:42:33,918
IF THE END OF CIVILIZATION
AS WE KNOW IT OCCURRED.

975
00:42:33,918 --> 00:42:36,255
AND THIS GUY HADN’T GOTTEN
HIS DRIVING PERMIT YET.

976
00:42:36,255 --> 00:42:39,858
WOULDN’T THAT BE NUTS?

977
00:42:39,858 --> 00:42:41,860
SO LET’S TAKE
A LOOK AT THE GANG

978
00:42:41,860 --> 00:42:43,528
AND SEE WHAT THEY
PUT TOGETHER HERE.

979
00:42:43,528 --> 00:42:45,530
JOIN OUR HERO AS
HE ENTERS THE LOST WORLD

980
00:42:45,530 --> 00:42:48,700
IN THE BACK OF HIS MOTHER’S
VISTA CRUISER STATION WAGON.

981
00:42:48,700 --> 00:42:51,070
COME-- COME ON,
MOM, LET’S GO.

982
00:42:51,070 --> 00:42:53,172
SPEAK UP,
I CAN’T UNDERSTAND YOU.

983
00:42:53,172 --> 00:42:54,807
I SAID, LET’S GO.

984
00:42:54,807 --> 00:42:56,575
I GOTTA TAKE MY PERMIT TEST

985
00:42:56,575 --> 00:42:59,043
SO I CAN FIGHT
THE IMPERIAL FORCES.

986
00:42:59,043 --> 00:43:00,947
YOU WILL DO NOTHING
OF THE KIND, YOUNG MAN.

987
00:43:00,947 --> 00:43:02,982
YOU’RE GOING TO GET
YOUR PERMIT THINGY,

988
00:43:02,982 --> 00:43:04,248
AND THEN WE HAVE
TO GO GET YOU

989
00:43:04,248 --> 00:43:05,483
A NICE PAIR OF SLACKS
FOR SCHOOL.

990
00:43:05,483 --> 00:43:06,718
AND THEN YOU’RE
GOING TO WAIT FOR MOM

991
00:43:06,718 --> 00:43:07,953
WHILE SHE PICKS OUT
A NEW BRA.

992
00:43:07,953 --> 00:43:09,722
OH SHOOT,
THERE’S DICKIE SCHNABEL!

993
00:43:09,722 --> 00:43:11,390
I CAN’T HAVE HIM SEE ME--
DUCK DOWN, MOM!

994
00:43:11,390 --> 00:43:12,825
- DUCK DOWN!
- I WILL NOT,

995
00:43:12,825 --> 00:43:15,127
I’LL WRINKLE MY PANTSUIT.
HELLO, DICKIE.

996
00:43:15,127 --> 00:43:17,128
HELLO, MRS. WARRIOR!

997
00:43:17,128 --> 00:43:18,863
[SERVO LAUGHS]

998
00:43:18,863 --> 00:43:20,898
BYE-BYE.
WHAT A NICE YOUNG MAN.

999
00:43:20,898 --> 00:43:23,002
WOULD YOU A NICE PAIR OF SLACKS
LIKE DICKIE HAS?

1000
00:43:23,002 --> 00:43:25,037
HE’S SUCH A NICE-- WOULD YOU
SIT UP STRAIGHT IN THAT SEAT?

1001
00:43:25,037 --> 00:43:27,438
- YES, MAN.
- YOU’LL GET RICKETS,
FOR HEAVEN’S SAKE.

1002
00:43:27,438 --> 00:43:29,642
OH, NOW WE’RE HERE.
NOW HURRY UP.

1003
00:43:29,642 --> 00:43:31,510
- OKAY.
- AND STOP MUMBLING!

1004
00:43:31,510 --> 00:43:34,480
OKAY... [JOEL MUMBLES]

1005
00:43:34,480 --> 00:43:36,148
[SERVO LAUGHS]

1006
00:43:36,148 --> 00:43:38,950
WELL, OUR HERO DOESN’T
PASS THE DRIVING TEST,

1007
00:43:38,950 --> 00:43:40,118
AS YOU CAN IMAGINE.

1008
00:43:40,118 --> 00:43:41,253
SO, LET’S SEE WHAT HAPPENS

1009
00:43:41,253 --> 00:43:44,757
NOW THAT HE HAS
TO FACE MOM WITH THE NEWS.

1010
00:43:44,757 --> 00:43:46,725
MAN, THAT WAS TOTALLY BOGUS.

1011
00:43:46,725 --> 00:43:50,262
I MISSED GETTING MY PERMIT
BY 20 LOUSY POINTS.

1012
00:43:50,262 --> 00:43:52,097
- SHOOT!
- LANGUAGE, DEAR.

1013
00:43:52,097 --> 00:43:53,365
AND STOP SLOUCHING.

1014
00:43:53,365 --> 00:43:54,833
MOM, YOU GOTTA GET ME A RIDE

1015
00:43:54,833 --> 00:43:56,535
OVER TO THE LOST WORLD,
OKAY?

1016
00:43:56,535 --> 00:43:59,137
YOU’RE NOT GOING TO
THE LOST WORLD, YOUNG MAN.

1017
00:43:59,137 --> 00:44:00,472
I’VE GOT A LOT
OF ERRANDS TO RUN.

1018
00:44:00,472 --> 00:44:03,742
OH, FINE, THIS SUCKS.
I’M HOOFING IT HOME.

1019
00:44:03,742 --> 00:44:05,643
HELLO, MRS. WARRIOR.

1020
00:44:05,643 --> 00:44:08,047
HEY, WHY AREN’T YOU IN YOUR
SUPER-CHARGED CYCLE?

1021
00:44:08,047 --> 00:44:09,415
OH, SHUT UP!

1022
00:44:09,415 --> 00:44:10,915
JUST SHUT UP, ALL OF YOU!

1023
00:44:10,915 --> 00:44:13,652
SHUT UP!

1024
00:44:13,652 --> 00:44:16,622
- [MOVIE SIGN BLARES]
- OH, WE GOT MOVIE SIGN!

1025
00:44:24,597 --> 00:44:26,432
GUESS WE SHOULD’VE WRITTEN
AN ENDING TO THAT, HUH?

1026
00:44:26,432 --> 00:44:28,033
YEAH.

1027
00:44:28,033 --> 00:44:30,502
--VERY BASIC TERMS.

1028
00:44:30,502 --> 00:44:32,237
WELL, WHAT DO YOU THINK
OF OUR SALES APPROACH, TED?

1029
00:44:32,237 --> 00:44:34,473
NOW, WE’VE GOTTA GO OUT THERE
AND GET THEIR ATTENTION.

1030
00:44:34,473 --> 00:44:35,940
I WANT YOU TO DRESS
AS CAROL CHANNING.

1031
00:44:35,940 --> 00:44:38,143
GIVE ME YOUR GUNS.

1032
00:44:39,745 --> 00:44:43,382
WHAT’D YOU SAY? I WAS
THINKING ABOUT PAPER CHASE.

1033
00:44:43,382 --> 00:44:45,617
I SURE HOPE YOU KNOW
WHAT YOU’RE DOING.

1034
00:44:47,518 --> 00:44:49,955
IS HE UNZIPPING HIM?

1035
00:44:49,955 --> 00:44:51,990
NOW, GO ON OUT THERE
AND SHOW THEM WHO’S BOSS.

1036
00:44:51,990 --> 00:44:53,858
WHAT, IS SPRINGSTEEN HERE?

1037
00:44:53,858 --> 00:44:55,693
YOU MIGHT BE CRAZY.

1038
00:44:55,693 --> 00:44:58,897
THE ELDERS SAY
YOU’VE BEEN CHOSEN.

1039
00:44:58,897 --> 00:45:00,732
I KEEP HEARING ABOUT THAT.

1040
00:45:00,732 --> 00:45:02,667
MUTILATE THEM!

1041
00:45:05,737 --> 00:45:09,140
WHAT, ARE YOU TRYING
TO GET MY ATTENTION?

1042
00:45:09,140 --> 00:45:12,543
KIND OF LOOKS LIKE
ANY WHICH WAY BUT LOOSE.

1043
00:45:12,543 --> 00:45:14,547
OR ANY WHICH WAY YOU CAN.

1044
00:45:18,050 --> 00:45:20,952
HUH, IMAGINE
IF HE’D HIT HIM.

1045
00:45:27,058 --> 00:45:29,828
THIS IS FOR THE PAPER CHASE!

1046
00:45:35,200 --> 00:45:36,602
IT’S PAUL BUNYAN-ETTE.

1047
00:45:36,602 --> 00:45:38,737
OR IT’S BABE THE BLUE CAT.

1048
00:45:38,737 --> 00:45:41,072
JUST WHEN I THOUGHT
HE COULDN’T GET

1049
00:45:41,072 --> 00:45:43,975
ANY LESS APPEALING.

1050
00:45:43,975 --> 00:45:46,043
DON’T YOU HAVE TO GET TO
THE END OF THE RAINBOW SET?

1051
00:45:48,047 --> 00:45:49,380
HE HIT LITTLE JAKE.

1052
00:45:49,380 --> 00:45:52,417
I CAN’T BELIEVE IT.

1053
00:45:52,417 --> 00:45:53,752
GET HER!

1054
00:45:53,752 --> 00:45:55,720
IT’S IKE AND TINA!

1055
00:46:00,125 --> 00:46:03,862
YAY!

1056
00:46:03,862 --> 00:46:05,863
HE’S BEATING UP JULIAN BOND.

1057
00:46:05,863 --> 00:46:07,967
THAT’S WRONG.

1058
00:46:07,967 --> 00:46:09,400
[NINJA GRUNTS]

1059
00:46:09,400 --> 00:46:11,337
ALL RIGHT, NOW,
TAKE HIM OUT!

1060
00:46:11,337 --> 00:46:12,770
TAKE HIM OUT!

1061
00:46:12,770 --> 00:46:14,372
COME ON, THIS IS GETTING
OUT OF HAND.

1062
00:46:14,372 --> 00:46:15,907
IT’S NOT FUNNY, COME ON,
I CAN’T BREATHE.

1063
00:46:15,907 --> 00:46:19,410
COME ON, LET GO. LET GO!

1064
00:46:19,410 --> 00:46:20,778
YOU’VE GOT HIM!

1065
00:46:20,778 --> 00:46:24,248
OH, RIGHT IN THE STORE.

1066
00:46:24,248 --> 00:46:27,185
THAT’LL DO YOU.

1067
00:46:27,185 --> 00:46:29,655
COME ON!

1068
00:46:29,655 --> 00:46:32,892
TAKE HIM! TAKE HIM!

1069
00:46:32,892 --> 00:46:34,058
MATT DILLON!

1070
00:46:34,058 --> 00:46:36,027
ONE MORE TIME.

1071
00:46:36,027 --> 00:46:37,128
D’OH.

1072
00:46:37,128 --> 00:46:40,232
I RESPECT HIM
IN A FUNNY WAY.

1073
00:46:40,232 --> 00:46:41,900
[WOMEN YELL]

1074
00:46:41,900 --> 00:46:44,537
YES, IT’S CURRY POWDER
WRESTLING.

1075
00:46:46,872 --> 00:46:48,740
[WOMEN SCREAM]

1076
00:46:48,740 --> 00:46:51,243
THEIR ENTHUSIASM
IS INFECTIOUS.

1077
00:46:55,847 --> 00:46:57,748
I’M YOUR PRIVATE DANCER!

1078
00:46:57,748 --> 00:46:59,317
OH, TAKE THAT.

1079
00:46:59,317 --> 00:47:00,952
MICKY DOLENZ!

1080
00:47:00,952 --> 00:47:03,288
MM, NUM, NUM.

1081
00:47:03,288 --> 00:47:06,123
THERE’S ABOUT EIGHT DIFFERENT
MOVIES BEING SHOT HERE.

1082
00:47:06,123 --> 00:47:08,260
NINJAS, PLEASE REPORT
TO THE MASTER NINJA SET.

1083
00:47:08,260 --> 00:47:10,195
GRUNGE GIRLS, YOU’RE NEEDED
ON THE MAD MAX SET.

1084
00:47:10,195 --> 00:47:13,165
WHAT ARE YOU PEOPLE FROM
THE PHILADELPHIA STORY
DOING HERE?

1085
00:47:13,165 --> 00:47:15,467
HYAH!

1086
00:47:15,467 --> 00:47:18,103
AND THAT CONCLUDES
THE FIRST QUARTER OF PLAY.

1087
00:47:21,473 --> 00:47:22,975
HE’S A WEED-WHIPPER.

1088
00:47:22,975 --> 00:47:24,375
WHICH WEED?

1089
00:47:24,375 --> 00:47:26,010
HEY, YOU KNOW, I WONDER
WHO THEY CALLED FOR THIS PART

1090
00:47:26,010 --> 00:47:27,378
BEFORE THE PAPER CHASE GUY?

1091
00:47:27,378 --> 00:47:29,180
- DAVID HASSELHOFF.
- EDWARD HERRMAN.

1092
00:47:29,180 --> 00:47:30,782
- TONY RANDALL.
- MOREY AMSTERDAM.

1093
00:47:30,782 --> 00:47:32,383
- RICHARD SIMMONS.
- GARRETT MORRIS.

1094
00:47:32,383 --> 00:47:33,685
- DAG HAMMARSKJOLD.

1095
00:47:33,685 --> 00:47:35,287
- JIM J. BULLOCK.
- NORMAN FELL.

1096
00:47:35,287 --> 00:47:36,788
- WILLIE AAMES.
- PETER ALLEN.

1097
00:47:36,788 --> 00:47:39,090
WILLIAM CONRAD.
AND MANY MORE.

1098
00:47:39,090 --> 00:47:40,725
[RIDER GRUNTS]

1099
00:47:40,725 --> 00:47:42,827
UH, HAMILTON, WHAT’RE YOU
DOING THERE, HAMILTON?

1100
00:47:45,763 --> 00:47:49,267
WAIT, WAIT, I’M THE WARRIOR
OF THE LOST WORLD!

1101
00:47:49,267 --> 00:47:50,602
HEY, WANNA THROW IN HERE,

1102
00:47:50,602 --> 00:47:52,870
JIMMY CARTER...
GARY BUSEY GUY?

1103
00:47:55,973 --> 00:47:58,010
WHOA, RIGHT IN THE YIN-YANG.

1104
00:48:01,913 --> 00:48:04,717
IT’S KUNG-FOLEY.

1105
00:48:04,717 --> 00:48:06,050
HOPE YOU LIKE THE

1106
00:48:06,050 --> 00:48:07,552
DOORS!

1107
00:48:07,552 --> 00:48:09,120
FUNNY.

1108
00:48:16,093 --> 00:48:17,495
WELL, THERE YOU GO.

1109
00:48:17,495 --> 00:48:19,397
SONNY AND CHER, LIKE
YOU’VE NEVER SEEN THEM BEFORE.

1110
00:48:19,397 --> 00:48:21,400
COME ON, YEAH, COME ON.

1111
00:48:32,310 --> 00:48:34,713
- ANDERSON, THAT’S ME.
- YEAH!

1112
00:48:34,713 --> 00:48:36,748
NOM NOM NOM.

1113
00:48:40,018 --> 00:48:42,253
YOU KNOW, SURE,
SHE’S THE WINNER,

1114
00:48:42,253 --> 00:48:44,088
BUT SHE’S STILL
GOING HOME ALONE.

1115
00:48:44,088 --> 00:48:45,590
JUST LIKE MARVIN HAMLISCH.

1116
00:48:45,590 --> 00:48:49,460
MM-HMM.

1117
00:48:49,460 --> 00:48:51,430
WE GOT SPIRIT, YES WE DO.

1118
00:48:51,430 --> 00:48:55,033
♪ WE GOT SPIRIT
HOW ABOUT YOU? ♪

1119
00:48:55,033 --> 00:48:57,368
I GUESS IT’S JUST
YOU AND ME NOW.

1120
00:48:57,368 --> 00:48:59,403
CLEOPATRA JONES.

1121
00:48:59,403 --> 00:49:01,440
♪ WAKA-CHICKA WAKA-CHICKA ♪

1122
00:49:05,010 --> 00:49:07,045
- SHALL WE DANCE?
- SURE, WHY NOT?

1123
00:49:07,045 --> 00:49:09,580
- [JOEL] YAY!
- [ALL] WHOO!

1124
00:49:09,580 --> 00:49:13,318
- ALL RIGHT.
- YES.

1125
00:49:13,318 --> 00:49:15,787
SUCKER.

1126
00:49:15,787 --> 00:49:18,223
YEAH, YOU’RE RIGHT.

1127
00:49:18,223 --> 00:49:21,893
OOH, NO, I HATE HIS
EVER-LOVING GUTS NOW.

1128
00:49:21,893 --> 00:49:24,195
WHO DOES HE THINK HE IS,
DANNY BONADUCE?

1129
00:49:25,830 --> 00:49:27,165
HOW YOU DOIN’, HONEY?

1130
00:49:27,165 --> 00:49:29,935
ALL RIGHT, I GUESS.

1131
00:49:29,935 --> 00:49:31,403
TAKE ONLY PICTURES, PEOPLE.

1132
00:49:31,403 --> 00:49:33,705
LEAVE ONLY FOOTPRINTS.

1133
00:49:33,705 --> 00:49:36,408
SO, ANYWAY, I GOT
A SPOT IN MY NEW DRESS,

1134
00:49:36,408 --> 00:49:37,742
AND THAT’S WHY
I’M WEARING THIS.

1135
00:49:37,742 --> 00:49:41,112
OH, WELL, WAIT, I JUST WANNA
TELL YOU ONE MORE THING.

1136
00:49:41,112 --> 00:49:42,913
UGH, GOT SOME DIVINE ON ME.

1137
00:49:47,918 --> 00:49:49,220
[CROW AS CARTER]
HI, I’M JIMMY CARTER.

1138
00:49:49,220 --> 00:49:50,555
I’M RUNNING FOR PRESIDENT.

1139
00:49:50,555 --> 00:49:53,158
- YOU DID FINE OUT THERE.
- I KNEW YOU COULD DO IT.

1140
00:49:53,158 --> 00:49:55,227
CLINTON’S NEW CABINET.

1141
00:49:55,227 --> 00:49:56,962
RAISE YOUR FIST.

1142
00:49:56,962 --> 00:49:58,330
GO ON, DO IT.

1143
00:49:58,330 --> 00:50:01,633
ASK HER OUT.

1144
00:50:01,633 --> 00:50:03,768
ALL RIGHT, THANKS
FOR COMING OUT TODAY!

1145
00:50:03,768 --> 00:50:05,103
[CROWD CHEERS]

1146
00:50:05,103 --> 00:50:06,638
WAIT A MINUTE--
THIS IS ALL IT TAKES?

1147
00:50:06,638 --> 00:50:10,075
NOW, WHY DIDN’T I
DO THIS FIRST?

1148
00:50:10,075 --> 00:50:13,678
HEY.

1149
00:50:13,678 --> 00:50:16,180
THEY LOVE IT WHEN
HE SIGNALS A LEFT TURN!

1150
00:50:19,317 --> 00:50:21,285
[ALL] UNION! UNION!

1151
00:50:21,285 --> 00:50:23,255
UNION!

1152
00:50:23,255 --> 00:50:25,923
OH, NOW HE’S
THE MAYOR OF LOSERVILLE.

1153
00:50:25,923 --> 00:50:29,728
BOING, BOING, BOING.

1154
00:50:29,728 --> 00:50:31,028
NOW, EVERYBODY!

1155
00:50:31,028 --> 00:50:33,498
[ALL] ATTICA!
ATTICA! ATTICA!

1156
00:50:36,267 --> 00:50:37,735
HERE AT DeVRY INSTITUTE,

1157
00:50:37,735 --> 00:50:40,105
- WE WORK WITH A NUMBER OF--
- OOH!

1158
00:50:40,105 --> 00:50:41,940
- HUH?
- OOH!

1159
00:50:41,940 --> 00:50:44,042
HE HYPNOTIZED HER INTO
THINKING SHE’S A PIGEON.

1160
00:50:44,042 --> 00:50:46,712
NO, IT’S LIKE BARBARELLA.
HE’S GONNA PLAY HER NOW.

1161
00:50:46,712 --> 00:50:48,780
OH.

1162
00:50:48,780 --> 00:50:50,782
OPERATION. THE GOOFY GAME

1163
00:50:50,782 --> 00:50:52,717
FOR DOPEY DOCTORS.

1164
00:50:54,820 --> 00:50:57,188
♪ RIDIN’ THE STORM OUT ♪

1165
00:50:57,188 --> 00:51:00,158
[SERVO MIMICS DRUMS]

1166
00:51:00,158 --> 00:51:01,827
I’D LOVE TO TURN YOU ON,

1167
00:51:01,827 --> 00:51:04,495
BUT I DON’T KNOW HOW.

1168
00:51:04,495 --> 00:51:06,465
IT’S FREEZING IN HERE.

1169
00:51:08,267 --> 00:51:10,468
OH, SICK, HE’S TURNING HER
INTO CHARLIE CALLAS.

1170
00:51:12,837 --> 00:51:15,173
DO YOU HAVE TO SCHOOL TO LEARN
HOW TO ACT LIKE THAT?

1171
00:51:15,173 --> 00:51:16,575
[NASTASIA SCREAMS]

1172
00:51:16,575 --> 00:51:19,543
I HAVEN’T EVEN TURNED IT ON.

1173
00:51:19,543 --> 00:51:21,278
THE REAL WORLD--

1174
00:51:21,278 --> 00:51:24,115
- ON MTV.
- --ISN’T A VERY NICE PLACE.

1175
00:51:25,317 --> 00:51:28,187
IS IT, MY DEAR?

1176
00:51:28,187 --> 00:51:29,620
DON’T EVER GOB ON ME AGAIN!

1177
00:51:29,620 --> 00:51:32,823
--CONTROL YOUR MIND.

1178
00:51:32,823 --> 00:51:35,027
YOU WILL HAVE
NO PERSONALITY OF YOUR OWN.

1179
00:51:35,027 --> 00:51:36,562
OH, LIKE ANYBODY
WOULD NOTICE.

1180
00:51:36,562 --> 00:51:39,597
YOU WILL ANSWER ONLY TO ME.

1181
00:51:39,597 --> 00:51:41,933
D’AH, OKAY.

1182
00:51:41,933 --> 00:51:43,368
WHEN I’VE FINISHED
WITH YOU--

1183
00:51:43,368 --> 00:51:44,803
I’LL MOVE ON TO MODEL SHIPS.

1184
00:51:44,803 --> 00:51:48,373
--YOU WILL BE ATTACHED
TO A MACHINE

1185
00:51:48,373 --> 00:51:50,375
WHICH WILL DRAW ITS ENERGY
FROM YOUR BODY.

1186
00:51:50,375 --> 00:51:52,543
UH, STAIRMASTER?

1187
00:51:52,543 --> 00:51:55,947
YOU WILL BE A SLAVE

1188
00:51:55,947 --> 00:51:57,348
ON THE ASSEMBLY LINE.

1189
00:51:57,348 --> 00:52:00,418
OH, YES.

1190
00:52:00,418 --> 00:52:02,920
GO AHEAD, SEVEN.

1191
00:52:02,920 --> 00:52:05,490
HUH? OOH.

1192
00:52:05,490 --> 00:52:08,593
OH MAN, HE’S JUST BEEN SHOT
BY THE SPLIT ENDS.

1193
00:52:10,528 --> 00:52:12,363
OH, AND THEY’RE
CYCLE-JACKING.

1194
00:52:18,170 --> 00:52:21,573
WELL, WHAT DO YOU KNOW?
THERE’S OUR GANG.

1195
00:52:21,573 --> 00:52:23,175
OH, YOU KNOW,
I ALWAYS GET CAUGHT

1196
00:52:23,175 --> 00:52:26,443
BEHIND MILITANT LEFTISTS
WHEN I GO UP NORTH.

1197
00:52:26,443 --> 00:52:27,678
WHERE’RE YOU HEADED, MAN?

1198
00:52:27,678 --> 00:52:28,913
OH, NOWHERE IN PARTIC--

1199
00:52:28,913 --> 00:52:30,182
OH, LOOK,
I’M NOT GONNA DO ANOTHER

1200
00:52:30,182 --> 00:52:33,050
THERE CAME BRONSON
REFERENCE.

1201
00:52:33,050 --> 00:52:34,818
♪ WE GOT A MIGHTY CONVOY ♪

1202
00:52:34,818 --> 00:52:37,188
♪ AIN’T IT
A BEAUTIFUL SIGHT? ♪

1203
00:52:37,188 --> 00:52:39,657
THAT’S MY FAVORITE
C.W. McCALL SONG.

1204
00:52:42,393 --> 00:52:43,795
[SERVO MIMICS DOG PANT]

1205
00:52:43,795 --> 00:52:45,997
- [CROW MIMICS DOG]
- ARF ARF!

1206
00:52:45,997 --> 00:52:48,900
THE FEW, THE PROUD,
THE EXTRAS.

1207
00:52:50,468 --> 00:52:52,470
REALLY, WALLY,
THIS THING WORKS BETTER

1208
00:52:52,470 --> 00:52:55,940
AT ABOUT A THOUSAND FEET.

1209
00:52:55,940 --> 00:52:58,377
THEY’RE ALL HEADING
TO STURGIS, YOU KNOW.

1210
00:52:58,377 --> 00:52:59,677
OH.

1211
00:52:59,677 --> 00:53:01,880
LOOKS LIKE
A WINE COUNTRY SAFARI.

1212
00:53:04,215 --> 00:53:06,017
YOU KNOW, LARRY, IF WE
WANTED TO BE ON THE ROAD,

1213
00:53:06,017 --> 00:53:09,922
WE SHOULD’VE BOUGHT A TRUCK.

1214
00:53:09,922 --> 00:53:13,090
I THOUGHT AUDIOS AMIGOS
WOULD PUT ME OVER THE TOP.

1215
00:53:13,090 --> 00:53:16,293
I GOT YOU.

1216
00:53:16,293 --> 00:53:18,663
THERE-- THERE, YOU SEE,
IT JUST FEEDS THE GAS BETTER

1217
00:53:18,663 --> 00:53:20,998
WHEN YOU GO UP
A COUPLE HUNDRED FEET OR SO.

1218
00:53:27,172 --> 00:53:30,008
UNIROYAL TIGER PAWS.

1219
00:53:31,442 --> 00:53:33,612
YOU STILL HAVE
"PERIMETER" MISSPELLED.

1220
00:53:38,517 --> 00:53:40,618
FOR THE LAST TIME,
DO YOU HAVE ANY FRUIT?

1221
00:53:42,887 --> 00:53:43,955
DO YOU SEE WHAT I SEE?

1222
00:53:43,955 --> 00:53:46,625
[ALL] ♪ A STAR, A STAR ♪

1223
00:53:48,393 --> 00:53:51,262
HEY, IT’S THE CAR
FROM THE BENETTON AD.

1224
00:53:56,033 --> 00:53:58,303
BE A LOT EASIER TO GO OVER ’EM
THAN IT IS THROUGH ’EM.

1225
00:53:58,303 --> 00:53:59,703
[COMPUTER REPEATS]

1226
00:53:59,703 --> 00:54:01,205
WHAT, ACT?

1227
00:54:01,205 --> 00:54:02,840
YOU GOT ANY BRIGHT IDEAS?

1228
00:54:04,375 --> 00:54:05,910
I AIN’T IN THE MOOD
FOR SURPRISES.

1229
00:54:08,947 --> 00:54:12,183
CHITTY-CHITTY KILL KILL.

1230
00:54:12,183 --> 00:54:14,652
YEAH, I GUESS A GOOD STUNT
DESERVES A SECOND LOOK.

1231
00:54:14,652 --> 00:54:17,755
HOW THE HELL
DID YOU DO THAT?

1232
00:54:17,755 --> 00:54:19,090
OH, THAT’S WHAT I THOUGHT.

1233
00:54:19,090 --> 00:54:22,893
YOU’RE BECOMING
A REAL WISE-ASS.

1234
00:54:22,893 --> 00:54:26,698
- BLUTO, NO!
- AH, POPEYE.

1235
00:54:26,698 --> 00:54:29,933
I TOLD YOU WE SHOULD’VE
BROUGHT THE TRUCK.

1236
00:54:31,302 --> 00:54:32,903
♪ SMASH BANG CRASH-EM-UP ♪

1237
00:54:32,903 --> 00:54:34,472
♪ IT’S SMASH-UP DERBY,
MY FRIENDS ♪

1238
00:54:34,472 --> 00:54:38,310
SUDDENLY, HAL NEEDHAM
HAS INVADED THE FILM.

1239
00:54:38,310 --> 00:54:40,078
YOU KNOW, THERE ARE
STIFF PENALTIES

1240
00:54:40,078 --> 00:54:42,213
FOR LEAVING THE SCENE
OF AN ACCIDENT.

1241
00:54:46,150 --> 00:54:48,920
JIMMY CARTER
IN RAT PATROL.

1242
00:54:50,288 --> 00:54:53,223
THAT’S A SCREENSAVER THERE.

1243
00:54:53,223 --> 00:54:55,427
THE ONLY THING KEEPING THIS
FROM BEING CANNONBALL RUN

1244
00:54:55,427 --> 00:54:57,395
IS DOM DeLUISE.

1245
00:55:00,432 --> 00:55:02,800
HOW COME YOU DIDN’T SEE THAT,
WISE GUY?

1246
00:55:04,368 --> 00:55:06,503
[SIRENS BLARE]

1247
00:55:09,907 --> 00:55:12,743
THIS ISN’T MAD MAX,
IT’S SAD MAX.

1248
00:55:12,743 --> 00:55:14,745
[SERVO CHUCKLES]

1249
00:55:18,182 --> 00:55:19,483
♪ HARE KRISHNA! ♪

1250
00:55:19,483 --> 00:55:21,018
♪ HARE KRISHNA! ♪

1251
00:55:25,157 --> 00:55:27,092
BOY, THESE L.A. FREEWAYS.

1252
00:55:27,092 --> 00:55:29,060
DON’T GET ME STARTED!

1253
00:55:31,128 --> 00:55:34,765
CALL HIGHWAY HELPERS.

1254
00:55:34,765 --> 00:55:36,633
EH, POLICE-STATE DWEEBS!

1255
00:55:36,633 --> 00:55:38,437
ANARCHIST JERKS!

1256
00:55:38,437 --> 00:55:39,770
FEMMES!

1257
00:55:39,770 --> 00:55:41,105
WUSSIES!

1258
00:55:41,105 --> 00:55:43,775
UGH!

1259
00:55:43,775 --> 00:55:45,477
AAH!

1260
00:55:45,477 --> 00:55:47,945
OW, MY FINGER!

1261
00:55:47,945 --> 00:55:49,547
BADOW! BADOW! BADOW!

1262
00:55:49,547 --> 00:55:52,450
[ALL] PEW PEW PEW!

1263
00:55:52,450 --> 00:55:54,752
HEY, HE’S RIDING SHOTGUN,

1264
00:55:54,752 --> 00:55:56,420
LITERALLY!

1265
00:55:56,420 --> 00:55:57,988
BADADADA! BADADADA!

1266
00:55:57,988 --> 00:55:59,957
- BADDA BADDA BADDA!
- AT-AT-AT-AT!

1267
00:55:59,957 --> 00:56:01,358
- HEY, WHAT’RE WE FIGHTING FOR?

1268
00:56:01,358 --> 00:56:02,760
♪ DON’T ASK ME,
DON’T GIVE A DAMN ♪

1269
00:56:02,760 --> 00:56:05,930
♪ NEXT STOP, VIETNAM ♪

1270
00:56:05,930 --> 00:56:07,865
OKAY, OKAY,
WE GET THE GENERAL IDEA.

1271
00:56:07,865 --> 00:56:09,333
- YEP.
- THAT’S ENOUGH.

1272
00:56:09,333 --> 00:56:12,137
THEY’RE OMEGA COURIERS.

1273
00:56:12,137 --> 00:56:14,238
ON YOUR LEFT!

1274
00:56:14,238 --> 00:56:16,507
OH, POPEYE!

1275
00:56:16,507 --> 00:56:18,810
OH, THIS IS, UH,
REAL SWEET AND ALL,

1276
00:56:18,810 --> 00:56:21,645
BUT WHAT THE HECK
IS GOING ON?

1277
00:56:23,347 --> 00:56:25,517
PEW-PEW-PEW.

1278
00:56:25,517 --> 00:56:28,018
HUH?

1279
00:56:28,018 --> 00:56:29,553
- HUH?
- HE WANTS TO PASS.

1280
00:56:32,023 --> 00:56:34,225
OMEGA EXPRESS, WHEN
HE ABSOLUTELY, POSITIVELY

1281
00:56:34,225 --> 00:56:36,693
HAS TO BE KILLED OVERNIGHT.

1282
00:56:36,693 --> 00:56:39,263
- [MAN LAUGHS]
- AH, POPEYE!

1283
00:56:39,263 --> 00:56:41,598
WHOOP, THERE GOES
THE BLACK BOX.

1284
00:56:41,598 --> 00:56:44,135
WHY CAN’T THEY MAKE THE CAR
OUT OF THE BLACK BOX?

1285
00:56:44,135 --> 00:56:45,803
- MM-HMM.
- HAH, I’M OUTTA HERE.

1286
00:56:45,803 --> 00:56:47,838
OH, THERE’S THE LANDAU ROOF.

1287
00:56:51,675 --> 00:56:53,043
MEANWHILE,
IN THE FLORIDA EVERGLADES,

1288
00:56:53,043 --> 00:56:56,180
DRUG ADDICTS
ARE CHASING BEN.

1289
00:56:56,180 --> 00:56:58,415
THIS IS A BAD TIME FOR
A LITTLE RIDE IN THE COUNTRY.

1290
00:56:58,415 --> 00:57:01,887
HEY, IT SPEAKS LIKE OUR
BITTERSWEET HEARTS, YOU GUYS.

1291
00:57:03,353 --> 00:57:04,855
OH, LOOK, IT’S KEN KESEY

1292
00:57:04,855 --> 00:57:06,623
AND HIS MERRY PRANKSTERS.

1293
00:57:06,623 --> 00:57:08,058
LADIES AND GENTLEMEN,
ON THE LEFT SIDE

1294
00:57:08,058 --> 00:57:09,760
OF THE TOUR BUS,
YOU’LL SEE WHERE THEY FILMED

1295
00:57:09,760 --> 00:57:13,097
THE NEW ADAM-12
AND THE NEW MUNSTERS.

1296
00:57:13,097 --> 00:57:16,267
HEY, YOU’RE GOING
THE WRONG WAY!

1297
00:57:20,138 --> 00:57:21,907
BOY, THE MOST WE EVER DID

1298
00:57:21,907 --> 00:57:25,075
WAS GIVE SOMEBODY
THE FINGER, JEEZ.

1299
00:57:25,075 --> 00:57:27,278
SOMEBODY’S IN
THE WRONG MOOD HERE.

1300
00:57:27,278 --> 00:57:29,413
BADOW! BADADOW!

1301
00:57:29,413 --> 00:57:31,850
THEY SHOT A POP-TENT!

1302
00:57:31,850 --> 00:57:34,518
WHAT IF THEY GAVE A WAR,
AND NOBODY ACTED?

1303
00:57:37,555 --> 00:57:39,257
LET’S JUST GET
BACK UP ON THE ROAD, HUH?

1304
00:57:39,257 --> 00:57:43,060
HEY, HE PROGRAMMED IT
TO BE AL LEWIS.

1305
00:57:43,060 --> 00:57:45,963
JIMMY CARTER IS ROMMEL.

1306
00:57:52,403 --> 00:57:54,005
- AAH!
- OOH.

1307
00:57:54,005 --> 00:57:56,573
JEEZ, A LITTLE HEARTBURN,
AND THE GUY’S OUT OF THERE, HUH?

1308
00:57:56,573 --> 00:57:59,477
MAN, THEY’RE SO CLOSE
THEY COULD JUST POKE EACH OTHER.

1309
00:57:59,477 --> 00:58:00,878
PEW-PEW! PEW-PEW!

1310
00:58:00,878 --> 00:58:02,880
BADOW BADOW!
BADADOW! BADADOW!

1311
00:58:02,880 --> 00:58:04,115
[JOEL MIMICS GUN]

1312
00:58:04,115 --> 00:58:06,817
BOB MARLEY!

1313
00:58:06,817 --> 00:58:07,985
OH NO.

1314
00:58:07,985 --> 00:58:11,822
SO HOW’S A TELEPHOTO LENS
GONNA HELP?

1315
00:58:11,822 --> 00:58:13,457
OH.

1316
00:58:13,457 --> 00:58:15,860
YEAH! ALL RIGHT!

1317
00:58:15,860 --> 00:58:17,895
SORRY, MR. ROCKFORD.

1318
00:58:20,632 --> 00:58:23,935
HUH.

1319
00:58:23,935 --> 00:58:27,105
THERE GOES ANOTHER.

1320
00:58:27,105 --> 00:58:29,340
OH, YEAH, THAT’S GONNA
PUT THE PANFISH DOWN

1321
00:58:29,340 --> 00:58:30,942
FOR A COUPLE OF HOURS.

1322
00:58:30,942 --> 00:58:32,777
- OH YAH.
- YOU KNOW IT TOO.
- FOR SURE.

1323
00:58:35,280 --> 00:58:36,680
WHOSE... WOODS ARE THESE?

1324
00:58:36,680 --> 00:58:38,717
I... THINK I KNOW.

1325
00:58:38,717 --> 00:58:41,953
YOU’RE NOT GETTING LOST,
ARE YOU?

1326
00:58:41,953 --> 00:58:43,487
THE COMPUTER’S
DOING CALLBACKS.

1327
00:58:43,487 --> 00:58:46,223
YOU’RE STARTING TO GET
ON MY NERVES, YOU KNOW THAT?

1328
00:58:46,223 --> 00:58:49,693
YEAH, WAY TO THROW IT
BACK IN HIS FACE.

1329
00:58:49,693 --> 00:58:53,463
HEY, WE’RE SHOOTING
OURSELVES NOW.

1330
00:58:53,463 --> 00:58:56,533
YOUR TAILLIGHT’S OUT.

1331
00:58:56,533 --> 00:58:58,670
UGH, UH, THERE.

1332
00:59:04,075 --> 00:59:06,543
UH, THINGS THAT KEEP YOU
FROM GETTING THROUGH.

1333
00:59:06,543 --> 00:59:08,580
YOU’RE JUST FULL OF GOOD NEWS,
TODAY, AREN’T YOU?

1334
00:59:08,580 --> 00:59:10,582
[ALL] WHAT?

1335
00:59:10,582 --> 00:59:12,783
SOUNDED LIKE, "JUDAS FOOD
CHEWED HIS ORANGE JUICE."

1336
00:59:12,783 --> 00:59:14,452
OH. OH-- HUH?

1337
00:59:14,452 --> 00:59:16,853
OH, NOW THIS IS LIKE
THE OMNI THEATER.

1338
00:59:16,853 --> 00:59:20,392
- LEAN INTO IT.
- I’M GETTING KIND OF SICK.

1339
00:59:20,392 --> 00:59:22,227
[SERVO MIMICS RICOCHETS]

1340
00:59:26,830 --> 00:59:28,900
OH, YOU WANNA PLAY ROUGH NOW,
EH POPEYE?

1341
00:59:28,900 --> 00:59:30,200
UH, YEAH.

1342
00:59:33,537 --> 00:59:35,407
LET’S GET THE WARHEADS
AT FULL CAPACITY.

1343
00:59:35,407 --> 00:59:38,442
WHAT? "SKIP DIONNE WARWICK
AND EAT A PASTY"?

1344
00:59:38,442 --> 00:59:41,545
- YES.
- WHAT THE--

1345
00:59:41,545 --> 00:59:43,815
WELL, PASS ALREADY!

1346
00:59:45,917 --> 00:59:47,685
OOH. WELL,

1347
00:59:47,685 --> 00:59:50,822
TRIED TO WAVE HIM THROUGH,
BUT HE SHOT ME IN THE ARM.

1348
00:59:50,822 --> 00:59:52,590
[MAN LAUGHS]

1349
00:59:52,590 --> 00:59:53,590
OH, ONE OF THOSE, LOOK.

1350
00:59:53,590 --> 00:59:55,225
YOU GOTTA WATCH OUT
FOR THOSE.

1351
00:59:55,225 --> 00:59:57,728
THEY CROP UP.

1352
00:59:57,728 --> 00:59:59,363
GET THE WIENERS.

1353
00:59:59,363 --> 01:00:01,732
THAT ALWAYS HAPPENS
AT THE BUS RODEO

1354
01:00:01,732 --> 01:00:04,068
WITH OLD-TIME BUS DRIVER
BILLY SLATER.

1355
01:00:04,068 --> 01:00:06,270
[SERVO HUMS THEME]

1356
01:00:16,047 --> 01:00:18,115
[SERVO HUMS MUZAK]

1357
01:00:21,118 --> 01:00:23,620
IT DOESN’T FEEL
LIKE A TUESDAY.

1358
01:00:26,790 --> 01:00:28,893
THE HANDMAID’S TALE.

1359
01:00:28,893 --> 01:00:30,928
[SERVO HUMS]

1360
01:00:33,998 --> 01:00:36,200
THOSE AREN’T REGULATION.

1361
01:00:42,873 --> 01:00:44,442
THIS FALL ON NBC.

1362
01:00:44,442 --> 01:00:46,577
BLACK NAZI, WHITE NINJAS,

1363
01:00:46,577 --> 01:00:49,947
AND THE BEIGE BERETS.

1364
01:00:49,947 --> 01:00:51,682
THIS FALL.

1365
01:00:53,617 --> 01:00:54,818
WAIT, THEY’RE DOING ALL THIS

1366
01:00:54,818 --> 01:00:56,453
JUST TO PAINT THE APARTMENT?

1367
01:00:56,453 --> 01:00:58,757
ROUGH NEIGHBORHOOD.

1368
01:01:01,292 --> 01:01:02,993
OOH.

1369
01:01:05,563 --> 01:01:09,033
THELMA? J.J.?
WE KNOW YOU’RE IN THERE!

1370
01:01:09,033 --> 01:01:12,203
I THINK, UH, CHARLES BUKOWSKI
DECORATED THIS PLACE.

1371
01:01:12,203 --> 01:01:13,670
- WHAT?
- WITH HIS VOMIT.

1372
01:01:13,670 --> 01:01:15,640
- [CROW GAGS]
- SORRY.

1373
01:01:17,208 --> 01:01:19,110
CAN YOU SEE ANYTHING
OUT OF YOUR GOGGLES?

1374
01:01:19,110 --> 01:01:22,247
- UH-UH.
- ME NEITHER.

1375
01:01:22,247 --> 01:01:25,082
OOH, HIS HAND
MUST REALLY SMELL.

1376
01:01:27,852 --> 01:01:31,322
NOW, REMEMBER EVERYONE.
WE’RE ON LEVEL A.

1377
01:01:31,322 --> 01:01:34,558
[SERVO MUMBLES]

1378
01:01:34,558 --> 01:01:36,827
IT’S LARGE MARGE.

1379
01:01:40,698 --> 01:01:43,200
LET’S ALL STOP
AND LOOK AT THE BIG TRUCK!

1380
01:01:44,968 --> 01:01:47,105
SO, WHAT KIND OF MILEAGE
YOU GETTING WITH THAT?

1381
01:01:51,142 --> 01:01:54,245
HUH?

1382
01:01:54,245 --> 01:01:56,880
HE OBVIOUSLY
ENJOYS HIS WORK.

1383
01:02:03,788 --> 01:02:06,023
WHOA, EXCUSE ME.
SERRANO CHILIS, YOU KNOW.

1384
01:02:12,897 --> 01:02:14,832
EVERYBODY’S HERE.

1385
01:02:17,535 --> 01:02:19,637
IT DOESN’T REALLY
DO ANYTHING.

1386
01:02:22,607 --> 01:02:24,308
OH. HI, CARL.

1387
01:02:27,178 --> 01:02:28,813
LARRY HOVIS.

1388
01:02:31,848 --> 01:02:35,085
OH, I THINK IT’S
SALMAN RUSHDIE’S RV.

1389
01:02:35,085 --> 01:02:38,255
HEY, HIS HAIR
STILL LOOKS GOOD.

1390
01:02:38,255 --> 01:02:39,690
SO WHAT THE HELL
IS THAT THING?

1391
01:02:39,690 --> 01:02:41,925
MEGAWEAPON! MEGAWEAPON!
MEGAWEAPON!

1392
01:02:41,925 --> 01:02:43,260
OH, WELL THAT-- HUH?

1393
01:02:43,260 --> 01:02:46,230
WHAT DOES IT TAKE
TO KNOCK THAT OUT?

1394
01:02:46,230 --> 01:02:48,232
40 MEGATONS--
HE CARRIES IT WELL.

1395
01:02:48,232 --> 01:02:51,135
- SAY.
- WHAT’S THE VULNERABILITY?

1396
01:02:51,135 --> 01:02:54,372
SORRY-NONE! SORRY-NONE!
SORRY-NONE!

1397
01:02:54,372 --> 01:02:55,807
WELL, WHAT DO THEY
EXPECT ME TO DO?

1398
01:02:55,807 --> 01:02:57,708
- WHAT, IS HIS JAW WIRED SHUT?
- YOU GOT ME! YOU GOT ME!

1399
01:02:57,708 --> 01:02:59,577
YOU GOT ME!

1400
01:02:59,577 --> 01:03:01,212
WHAT’S OUR OUTSIDE CHANCE?

1401
01:03:01,212 --> 01:03:02,380
COMPUTER TERMINAL UNDER!

1402
01:03:02,380 --> 01:03:03,547
COMPUTER TERMINAL UNDER!

1403
01:03:03,547 --> 01:03:04,682
COMPUTER TERMINAL UNDER!

1404
01:03:04,682 --> 01:03:08,218
THAT’S A GOOD PLACE FOR IT.

1405
01:03:08,218 --> 01:03:11,722
TOUGH, TOUGH, TOUGH.

1406
01:03:11,722 --> 01:03:13,690
YOU KNOW, I’M BEGINNING
TO LIKE THIS MEGAWEAPON.

1407
01:03:13,690 --> 01:03:17,362
I’D LOVE TO DRIVE
MEGAWEAPON TO SCHOOL.

1408
01:03:17,362 --> 01:03:20,598
BECAUSE SO MUCH
IS RIDING ON YOUR TIRES.

1409
01:03:20,598 --> 01:03:21,865
I’LL SEE YOU THERE.

1410
01:03:21,865 --> 01:03:24,268
LEAVE YOUR FRIENDS AND THE
CREEPS IN THIS PLACE.

1411
01:03:26,537 --> 01:03:28,238
HOLD ON HOTSHOT!
HOLD ON HOTSHOT!

1412
01:03:28,238 --> 01:03:31,042
HOLD ON HOTSHOT!

1413
01:03:31,042 --> 01:03:34,912
- DING.
- SHARP, HUH?

1414
01:03:34,912 --> 01:03:36,847
- HUH?
- WOW!

1415
01:03:39,550 --> 01:03:40,918
[ALL CHEER]

1416
01:03:40,918 --> 01:03:42,753
[ALL]
MEGAWEAPON! MEGAWEAPON!

1417
01:03:42,753 --> 01:03:44,455
MEGAWEAPON!

1418
01:03:44,455 --> 01:03:46,790
MAKE IT LAST. YES, YES.

1419
01:03:46,790 --> 01:03:48,258
MAKE IT SLOW, MEGAWEAPON.

1420
01:03:48,258 --> 01:03:49,560
YES, YES.

1421
01:03:49,560 --> 01:03:52,530
OUR LONG NATIONAL
NIGHTMARE IS OVER.

1422
01:03:52,530 --> 01:03:54,898
AHH.

1423
01:03:54,898 --> 01:03:56,600
YEAH.

1424
01:03:56,600 --> 01:03:58,903
[COMPUTER WHINES]

1425
01:03:58,903 --> 01:04:01,072
YES. YES.

1426
01:04:01,072 --> 01:04:02,740
[SERVO MUMBLES]

1427
01:04:02,740 --> 01:04:04,108
[COMPUTER WHINES]

1428
01:04:04,108 --> 01:04:06,243
[SERVO MUMBLES]

1429
01:04:06,243 --> 01:04:07,978
OH, YES.

1430
01:04:07,978 --> 01:04:10,447
BOY, HE AND THE TRUCK
ALMOST GOT IN THE SAME SHOT

1431
01:04:10,447 --> 01:04:12,617
FOR A MOMENT.

1432
01:04:12,617 --> 01:04:14,885
IT’S A MOTORIZED CAMILLE.

1433
01:04:17,588 --> 01:04:19,857
YEAH, TOUGH.

1434
01:04:19,857 --> 01:04:21,692
OH, DIE. DIE, MY DARLING.

1435
01:04:21,692 --> 01:04:23,093
[SERVO CHUCKLES]

1436
01:04:23,093 --> 01:04:24,728
GOT...ME.

1437
01:04:24,728 --> 01:04:26,463
YOU GOT ME, COPPER.

1438
01:04:26,463 --> 01:04:28,532
HE TAMPERED IN GOD’S DOMAIN.

1439
01:04:28,532 --> 01:04:30,735
I CAN’T TELL YOU HOW
RICHLY SATISFYING THIS IS.

1440
01:04:30,735 --> 01:04:32,202
[JOEL CHUCKLES]

1441
01:04:36,373 --> 01:04:37,808
GOT...

1442
01:04:37,808 --> 01:04:40,678
- NO.
- THIS NOW CONCLUDES
OUR PROGRAMMING DAY.

1443
01:04:44,948 --> 01:04:47,017
OH, HE’S GONNA PUT A POTATO

1444
01:04:47,017 --> 01:04:49,020
IN HIS EXHAUST PIPE.

1445
01:04:49,020 --> 01:04:52,022
VANDAL OF THE LOST WORLD.

1446
01:04:52,022 --> 01:04:54,758
REMEMBER, USE ONLY
GENUINE OMEGA PARTS.

1447
01:04:56,393 --> 01:04:58,628
NO, THAT’S WHERE
THE PORTA-POTTY DRAINS!

1448
01:04:58,628 --> 01:05:02,198
[SERVO RETCHES]

1449
01:05:02,198 --> 01:05:04,568
OH, SO THAT’S WHERE THAT IS.

1450
01:05:06,303 --> 01:05:09,107
[SERVO WHISTLES]

1451
01:05:09,107 --> 01:05:10,407
OOH.

1452
01:05:13,143 --> 01:05:14,578
[ALL] D’AH!

1453
01:05:14,578 --> 01:05:16,213
IT’S A D.D.T. TRUCK.

1454
01:05:16,213 --> 01:05:17,682
UGH.

1455
01:05:17,682 --> 01:05:19,383
HATE THOSE.

1456
01:05:27,292 --> 01:05:29,260
NOW THEY’RE GONNA CUT
TO THE CAR BLOW-UP.

1457
01:05:29,260 --> 01:05:31,528
- YEP.
- BET YOU ANYTHING.

1458
01:05:31,528 --> 01:05:34,832
SEAN PENN!

1459
01:05:34,832 --> 01:05:36,567
♪ WAKA-CHICKA
WAKA-CHICKA... ♪

1460
01:05:36,567 --> 01:05:38,468
♪ WHO’S THE 13-GEAR
ROAD RANGER ♪

1461
01:05:38,468 --> 01:05:40,437
♪ WHO’S A SEX MACHINE
TO ALL THE CHICKS? ♪

1462
01:05:40,437 --> 01:05:42,307
- ♪ MEGAWEAPON ♪
- DAMN RIGHT.

1463
01:05:42,307 --> 01:05:43,640
♪ THEY SAY MEGAWEAPON IS ♪

1464
01:05:43,640 --> 01:05:45,442
- ♪ BAD MOTHA--
- ♪ SHUT YOUR MOUTH ♪

1465
01:05:45,442 --> 01:05:47,010
♪ JUST TALKIN’
ABOUT MEGAWEAPON ♪

1466
01:05:47,010 --> 01:05:50,882
♪ WE CAN DIG IT ♪

1467
01:05:50,882 --> 01:05:52,248
THAT WAS FUN.

1468
01:05:52,248 --> 01:05:54,652
UH-OH.

1469
01:05:54,652 --> 01:05:55,853
NOT MEGAWEAPON!

1470
01:05:55,853 --> 01:05:57,922
NO! WHAT DID HE DO WRONG?

1471
01:05:57,922 --> 01:05:59,990
BRING YOUR GARBAGE!

1472
01:05:59,990 --> 01:06:02,125
- COME ON.
- NOT MEGAWEAPON.

1473
01:06:02,125 --> 01:06:05,162
MOVE IT, COME ON!

1474
01:06:05,162 --> 01:06:06,697
OH, MAN.

1475
01:06:06,697 --> 01:06:08,698
GO ON, PICK UP
MY BIKE UP THERE.

1476
01:06:08,698 --> 01:06:11,835
COME ON, CHARLIE,
THEY BUSTED MY BIKE!

1477
01:06:11,835 --> 01:06:15,138
COME ON, MOVE IT.

1478
01:06:15,138 --> 01:06:17,307
MEGAWEAPON’S COOLER
THAN ALL YOU GUYS.

1479
01:06:17,307 --> 01:06:19,377
YEAH.

1480
01:06:19,377 --> 01:06:21,545
MEGAWEAPON’S
SMOKING OVER THERE.

1481
01:06:27,985 --> 01:06:29,320
OH, I JUST WANTED
TO TELL YOU--

1482
01:06:29,320 --> 01:06:31,288
OH, FORGET IT.

1483
01:06:39,163 --> 01:06:40,663
BET THIS KIND OF REMINDS YOU

1484
01:06:40,663 --> 01:06:42,298
OF WHEN WE
LEFT YOUR DAUGHTER.

1485
01:06:42,298 --> 01:06:44,835
OH, HE’S OKAY. AAH!

1486
01:06:44,835 --> 01:06:48,738
- OH.
- AWW.

1487
01:06:48,738 --> 01:06:50,140
I REALIZED, AT THAT TIME,

1488
01:06:50,140 --> 01:06:51,375
I WAS BORN OF TWO FATHERS.

1489
01:06:51,375 --> 01:06:54,078
ELIAS AND MEGAWEAPON.

1490
01:06:54,078 --> 01:06:56,247
YEAH, BIG MAN
KILLED MEGAWEAPON.

1491
01:06:56,247 --> 01:06:57,482
I HOPE HE’S HAPPY.

1492
01:06:57,482 --> 01:06:59,083
MEGAWEAPON
DIED TRAGICALLY TODAY.

1493
01:06:59,083 --> 01:07:00,785
INVESTIGATORS STILL
HAVE NO CLUES

1494
01:07:00,785 --> 01:07:02,720
ABOUT THE MYSTERIOUS
EXPLOSION

1495
01:07:02,720 --> 01:07:04,255
THAT TOOK THE LIFE
OF THE BELOVED MEGAWEAPON.

1496
01:07:04,255 --> 01:07:06,657
HIS WIDOW HAS ASKED
THAT DONATIONS BE SENT

1497
01:07:06,657 --> 01:07:08,258
TO THE DEPARTMENT
OF TRANSPORTATION.

1498
01:07:08,258 --> 01:07:10,862
YOU KNOW WHAT,
I ALREADY MISS MEGAWEAPON.

1499
01:07:10,862 --> 01:07:13,963
[BOTS] ME, TOO.

1500
01:07:13,963 --> 01:07:17,468
WE FELL BACK
TO THE REINDEER LOT.

1501
01:07:17,468 --> 01:07:18,802
THE MALL OF AMERICA
WAS THE SCENE

1502
01:07:18,802 --> 01:07:20,570
OF A VIOLENT COUP TODAY.

1503
01:07:20,570 --> 01:07:23,640
[SERVO SOBS]

1504
01:07:23,640 --> 01:07:25,810
WAIT, I THOUGHT THEY WERE
ALL ON THE SAME SIDE.

1505
01:07:37,555 --> 01:07:38,955
- OR NUMBER FOUR--
- YOU KNOW, JOEL,

1506
01:07:38,955 --> 01:07:41,325
I HAVE TO SAY, WHAT WITH
THE LUSH GREEN COUNTRYSIDE,

1507
01:07:41,325 --> 01:07:43,227
THE WELL-MAINTAINED
ROADS AND BUILDINGS,

1508
01:07:43,227 --> 01:07:44,495
AND THE READY AVAILABILITY

1509
01:07:44,495 --> 01:07:46,230
OF TRANSPORTATION,
FOOD, AND FUEL,

1510
01:07:46,230 --> 01:07:48,732
I’M KIND OF LOOKING FORWARD
TO THE APOCALYPSE.

1511
01:07:48,732 --> 01:07:50,902
YEAH, PROVIDED
THAT PAPER CHASE GUY
DOESN’T SURVIVE.

1512
01:07:50,902 --> 01:07:52,903
YOU GUYS, THAT’S
A TERRIBLE THING TO SAY.

1513
01:07:52,903 --> 01:07:55,072
NO ONE’S LOOKING FORWARD
TO THE APOCALYPSE.

1514
01:07:55,072 --> 01:07:57,373
THOUGH I AGREE WITH YOU
ABOUT THE PAPER CHASE GUY.

1515
01:07:57,373 --> 01:07:59,008
BUT LOOK AT IT
THIS WAY, JOEL.

1516
01:07:59,008 --> 01:08:01,178
FACTOR OUT THE UNFATHOMABLE
HUMAN LOSS,

1517
01:08:01,178 --> 01:08:04,282
- AND A GUY COULD
REALLY GET A LOT DONE.
- THINK OF IT.

1518
01:08:04,282 --> 01:08:07,083
WHY, THE LINES AT
NORDSTROM’SWOULD ACTUALLY BE
QUITE LIGHT.

1519
01:08:07,083 --> 01:08:08,418
YEAH, A FELLA COULD PLAY

1520
01:08:08,418 --> 01:08:10,520
ENDLESS GAMES
OF STICKBALL ON I-94.

1521
01:08:10,520 --> 01:08:12,188
YEAH, I’D PROBABLY
TAKE SOME TIME OFF

1522
01:08:12,188 --> 01:08:13,957
AND DO SOME ENTERTAINING
OR SOMETHING.

1523
01:08:13,957 --> 01:08:15,358
OH, SURE YOU COULD.

1524
01:08:15,358 --> 01:08:17,160
IT’D BE REALLY FUN
TO MAKE A NUTRITIOUS,

1525
01:08:17,160 --> 01:08:19,930
WELL-BALANCED MEAL
AND THEN JUST LET IT GO BAD

1526
01:08:19,930 --> 01:08:22,733
WHILE YOU CRAM YOUR FACE
WITH T.J. BEARWICH COOKIES.

1527
01:08:22,733 --> 01:08:24,502
NO, I’D DRIVE
A TANK EVERYWHERE.

1528
01:08:24,502 --> 01:08:26,703
JUST BLOWING THE BEJEEBERS
OUT OF SOME OF MAN’S

1529
01:08:26,703 --> 01:08:28,338
GREATEST ARCHITECTURE
AS I WENT ALONG.

1530
01:08:28,338 --> 01:08:30,007
I GOT IT.
I’D WALK AROUND,

1531
01:08:30,007 --> 01:08:31,208
TOTALLY NAKED,

1532
01:08:31,208 --> 01:08:33,643
HOLDING A BIG-GULP
TERMINATOR 2 GLASS.

1533
01:08:33,643 --> 01:08:35,345
I COULD SEE YOU DOING THAT.

1534
01:08:35,345 --> 01:08:36,713
YOU KNOW, I’D START CARS

1535
01:08:36,713 --> 01:08:38,382
AND PUT BRICKS
ON THE ACCELERATORS

1536
01:08:38,382 --> 01:08:40,383
AND SEND ’EM SCREAMIN’
DOWN THE HIGHWAY

1537
01:08:40,383 --> 01:08:41,885
FOR DAYS ON END.

1538
01:08:41,885 --> 01:08:43,787
YOU KNOW, I’D FEEL
COMPLETELY UN-SELF-CONSCIOUS

1539
01:08:43,787 --> 01:08:45,990
ABOUT RENTING VIDEO TAPES
LIKE, OH, TURNER AND HOOCH,

1540
01:08:45,990 --> 01:08:47,525
THREE MEN
AND A LITTLE LADY.

1541
01:08:47,525 --> 01:08:48,858
YOU KNOW
WHAT I’D LIKE TO DO?

1542
01:08:48,858 --> 01:08:51,395
HEAD DOWN TO WIMBLEDON
AND HIT AROUND A LITTLE BIT.

1543
01:08:51,395 --> 01:08:53,663
AND THEN TRUCK ON OVER
TO ST. ANDREW’S.

1544
01:08:53,663 --> 01:08:55,165
DO A QUICK NINE, YOU KNOW.

1545
01:08:55,165 --> 01:08:56,433
I’D PUT FOOTBALL PADS ON

1546
01:08:56,433 --> 01:08:57,802
AND JUST GO
UP AND DOWN THE STREET

1547
01:08:57,802 --> 01:08:59,537
DIVING THROUGH
PLATE GLASS WINDOWS.

1548
01:08:59,537 --> 01:09:02,238
OH, I KNOW, I’D GO INTO
THE TAJ MAHAL ON MY MINIBIKE

1549
01:09:02,238 --> 01:09:03,640
AND JUST SPIN DONUTS!

1550
01:09:03,640 --> 01:09:05,408
AND BUST OUT THE WINDOWS
WITH A WRIST-ROCKET

1551
01:09:05,408 --> 01:09:07,143
USING DIAMONDS FOR AMMO!
WHOO-HOO-HOO!

1552
01:09:07,143 --> 01:09:08,445
YOU KNOW WHAT, GUYS,

1553
01:09:08,445 --> 01:09:09,780
THERE’S ONE THING
YOU GOTTA REMEMBER

1554
01:09:09,780 --> 01:09:11,448
IN THE EVENT OF APOCALYPSE.

1555
01:09:11,448 --> 01:09:12,783
YOU GOT TO BRING

1556
01:09:12,783 --> 01:09:14,385
AN EXTRA PAIR
OF PRESCRIPTION GLASSES.

1557
01:09:14,385 --> 01:09:15,785
RIGHT?

1558
01:09:15,785 --> 01:09:17,387
WELL, WHAT DO YOU MEAN?
WHY IS THAT?

1559
01:09:17,387 --> 01:09:19,190
WELL, SO YOU DON’T END UP
LIKE BURGESS MEREDITH

1560
01:09:19,190 --> 01:09:21,225
IN THE TWILIGHT ZONE.

1561
01:09:21,225 --> 01:09:22,527
OH, YEAH.
RIGHT, RIGHT, RIGHT.

1562
01:09:22,527 --> 01:09:24,195
’CAUSE THAT COULD HAPPEN,
AND, YOU KNOW,

1563
01:09:24,195 --> 01:09:25,897
YOU JUST WANNA BE PREPARED.

1564
01:09:25,897 --> 01:09:27,330
--EPISODE OF TWILIGHT ZONE,
’CAUSE OF THE APOCALYPSE.

1565
01:09:27,330 --> 01:09:29,065
HE HAD THOSE SHOES
’CAUSE THAT’S WHAT HE NEEDED.

1566
01:09:29,065 --> 01:09:30,633
- SHOES WERE A DIFFERENT ONE.
- HE HAD A THIRD EYE.

1567
01:09:30,633 --> 01:09:31,802
NO, NO, THAT’S
A DIFFERENT ONE TOO.

1568
01:09:41,445 --> 01:09:43,280
HEY, THAT GUY’S
BUYING LUNCH AT THE AUTOMAT.

1569
01:09:43,280 --> 01:09:45,215
OH, THAT SAME APPLE
AGAIN THERE.

1570
01:09:49,287 --> 01:09:51,488
THE WOMEN OF THE I.R.S.

1571
01:09:54,592 --> 01:09:56,360
I’M SO SURE.

1572
01:09:59,028 --> 01:10:00,463
[SERVO SIGHS]

1573
01:10:00,463 --> 01:10:03,200
BOY, I SURE HAVE A LOT
OF PAPERWORK TO DO TODAY.

1574
01:10:03,200 --> 01:10:04,768
I’M SO GLAD I CAME
INTO WORK EARLY,

1575
01:10:04,768 --> 01:10:08,205
SO THAT EVERYBODY HERE
COULD DIE!

1576
01:10:08,205 --> 01:10:10,740
FASTER, KELLY-GIRL,
KILL! KILL!

1577
01:10:13,177 --> 01:10:16,347
UH, LADIES, YOU’RE GONNA
HAVE TO DO THAT ON YOUR BR--

1578
01:10:16,347 --> 01:10:17,682
ALL RIGHT, YOU KILLED

1579
01:10:17,682 --> 01:10:19,215
THE SUPERVISOR
AND EVERYBODY IN THE PLANT.

1580
01:10:19,215 --> 01:10:23,020
THEY’RE JUST GONNA
HAVE TO WRITE YOU UP.

1581
01:10:23,020 --> 01:10:24,655
YOU KNOW, THEY HAVEN’T
EVEN WORKED THERE THAT LONG

1582
01:10:24,655 --> 01:10:27,592
TO BUILD UP
THAT MUCH STRESS.

1583
01:10:27,592 --> 01:10:29,560
THE COMPUTER
WORE PLATFORM SHOES.

1584
01:10:36,100 --> 01:10:38,035
YOU KNOW, IF YOU’RE GONNA
SEE THE APOCALYPSE,

1585
01:10:38,035 --> 01:10:40,437
YOU SHOULD SPEND THE MONEY
AND TAKE THE HELICOPTER TOUR.

1586
01:10:40,437 --> 01:10:41,772
- OH, YAH.
- YOU SEE IT ALL.

1587
01:10:41,772 --> 01:10:43,140
REALLY GOOD.

1588
01:10:48,812 --> 01:10:50,313
NICE DAY.

1589
01:10:50,313 --> 01:10:53,183
UH-HUH.

1590
01:10:53,183 --> 01:10:55,518
ALL RIGHT, LET’S MOVE.
WE’RE JUST A SITTING TARGET
HERE.

1591
01:10:55,518 --> 01:10:57,655
LET’S MOVE.

1592
01:10:57,655 --> 01:11:01,192
YEAH, NO ONE
CAN SEE YOU THERE.

1593
01:11:01,192 --> 01:11:02,927
- COVER ME.
- BENAZIR BHUTTO.

1594
01:11:05,795 --> 01:11:08,498
HEY, THEY KILLED THE LEADER
OF THE L.A. MINE COMPANY.

1595
01:11:09,833 --> 01:11:11,935
HEY, CAPTAIN?

1596
01:11:11,935 --> 01:11:13,703
PLANNING ON JOINING US?

1597
01:11:13,703 --> 01:11:15,272
ZING.

1598
01:11:15,272 --> 01:11:17,173
I’LL TAKE CARE
OF THE COPTER.

1599
01:11:17,173 --> 01:11:19,410
HEY, THIS KIND OF LOOKS LIKE
THE PLACE YOU LEFT MY DAUGHTER.

1600
01:11:19,410 --> 01:11:21,178
HMM. NICE GUY.

1601
01:11:21,178 --> 01:11:23,480
REAL SHAPELY.

1602
01:11:23,480 --> 01:11:26,583
IT’S MORNING IN JAPAN.

1603
01:11:26,583 --> 01:11:30,187
HEY, WE CAUGHT
ALL SIX GUARDS.

1604
01:11:30,187 --> 01:11:31,822
KEEP MOVING.

1605
01:11:31,822 --> 01:11:34,023
ALL RIGHT, SHOW’S OVER.
NOTHING TO SEE HERE.

1606
01:11:34,023 --> 01:11:36,760
MOVE ALONG NOW. DISPERSE.

1607
01:11:41,198 --> 01:11:43,667
ALL RIGHT, EVERYONE MEET
BY THE ONE-POTATO-TWO

1608
01:11:43,667 --> 01:11:46,503
IN AN HOUR AND A HALF.

1609
01:11:46,503 --> 01:11:49,373
I’M A MODEL BY DAY,
AND A BARBARIAN ON THE WEEKENDS,

1610
01:11:49,373 --> 01:11:53,277
IF YOU KNOW WHAT I MEAN.

1611
01:11:53,277 --> 01:11:55,612
STILL DON’T GET
THE BLACK NAZI.

1612
01:11:59,750 --> 01:12:03,787
DANIEL STERN
AND DAVID CROSBY!

1613
01:12:03,787 --> 01:12:06,257
HEY, ASK THEM IF THEY GOT
A KEY TO THE BATHROOM.

1614
01:12:11,128 --> 01:12:14,197
HEY-HEY, IT’S THE CRAZY
GUGGENHEIM.

